  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Initiating Project Review**\n\nI\'m now diving into the user\'s request. It\'s clear: an Android VPN app, DNS-blocking specific to Xiaomi/MIUI telemetry, lightweight, minimalist, and user-friendly. I\'m focusing on the core problem to define the scope and the specific features needed for successful execution. Currently, I\'m defining the essential project criteria.\n\n\n**Defining Blocking Rules**\n\nI\'ve specified the default blocklist with several Xiaomi and related telemetry domains, setting them to `0.0.0.0`. All other DNS queries are directed to Cloudflare or Google\'s servers. I plan to provide real-time logs and stats for connections and blocked requests. I\'m also considering optional features such as custom blocklist configuration and per-app bypass capabilities, accessible via the settings UI.\n\n\n"
