  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Assessing Technical Requirements**\n\nI\'ve just assessed the technical requirements for this phase. Thankfully, no additional skills are needed. The local persistent state using `localStorage` for the interactive Android app simulator is sufficient, along with the downloadable, inspectable production Kotlin `VpnService` project.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_501501"
      name: "view_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"AbsolutePath\":\"/skills/system_skills/frontend_design/SKILL.md\",\"toolAction\":\"Reading frontend design skill\",\"toolSummary\":\"Read frontend-design skill guidelines\"}"
