  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Crafting Implementation Plan**\n\nI\'m now focused on generating a detailed `implementation_plan.md` file. I\'m adhering strictly to the formatting rules and content hierarchy dictated by `planning-mode`. The goal is a comprehensive, human-readable document without file listings or directory trees, using clear Unicode box-drawing architecture.\n\n\n**Defining Application Specifications**\n\nI am now solidifying the specifications for \"MiGuard DNS.\" Key features are the interactive Android app with live telemetry and Kotlin code export. I\'ve pinpointed the default blocked Xiaomi/MIUI domains and defined upstream DNS resolvers. I\'m also planning the real-time connection logging and blocked request telemetry.\n\n\n**Detailing Feature Set**\n\nI\'m currently fleshing out the DNS query details for logging, focusing on displaying the domain, resolution status, latency, and counters in real-time. I\'m also designing an interactive DNS Query Tester, allowing users to verify sinkhole versus upstream forwarding for specific system packages. Finally, I\'m developing custom blocklist features with auto-suggested Xiaomi/MIUI telemetry rules, and a dual-mode per-app system package filter with both whitelist and bypass functionality.\n\n\n"
