            lines {
              text: "- **B\341\272\243ng m\303\240u (Color Palette & 60-30-10 Discipline)**:"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - **60% N\341\273\201n trung t\303\255nh s\303\242u (`--background`)**: T\303\264ng t\341\273\221i d\341\273\213u m\341\272\257t (`#090D16` / `slate-950`) ho\341\272\267c s\303\241ng s\341\272\241ch (`#F8FAFC` / `slate-50`) h\341\273\227 tr\341\273\243 chuy\341\273\203n \304\221\341\273\225i S\303\241ng/T\341\273\221i ho\303\240n ch\341\273\211nh."
