  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Executing the Plan**\n\nI\'m now fully immersed in Phase 3: Plan Execution, with a firm directive to integrate all three context sources. Currently, my focus is on synthesizing the Phase 1 Clarifications. The key deliverable is a functional, interactive Android VPN application experience.\n\n\n**Refining the Blocklist**\n\nI\'m now zeroing in on the blocklist functionality. I\'ve designed flexible per-app VPN modes: allowlist and blocklist, with user-friendly customization features. Specifically, I\'m integrating manual domain entry and the option to toggle each entry on/off. Furthermore, an auto-suggestion for Xiaomi/MIUI telemetry domains is in development, all adhering to the approved implementation plan.\n\n\n"
