  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining Core Data Structures**\n\nI\'m now focusing on defining the foundational data structures for the application. Specifically, I\'m creating the `/src/data/vpnDefaults.ts` file, which will house the initial list of blocked domains. This list will strictly adhere to the user\'s explicit request for five specific domains.\n\n\n**Expanding Data Structures**\n\nI\'ve expanded the data structures to include specific Xiaomi/MIUI telemetry suggestions, accessible with a single tap. I\'m also incorporating realistic Android and MIUI system packages. This includes package names, friendly labels, descriptions, and categories to facilitate user control, allowing users to toggle between allowlists and blocklists. Furthermore, I\'m integrating realistic background traffic domains for a more comprehensive approach.\n\n\n**Generating Kotlin Code**\n\nI\'m now generating actual Android Kotlin source code, including `MiGuardVpnService.kt`, `DnsPacketParser.kt`, `AndroidManifest.xml`, and `hosts.txt` using the real-time blocklist domains. The generator uses selected upstream DNS servers (either `1.1.1.1` or `8.8.8.8`) and chosen per-app filtering (allowlist or blocklist). This also includes a clean and smooth user interface that follows the frontend-design rules. The UI design will include the brand name, navigation links, and a primary action button.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_112370"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"export type DnsUpstream = \'1.1.1.1\' | \'8.8.8.8\';\\n\\nexport type AppFilterMode = \'allowlist\' | \'blocklist\';\\n\\nexport interface DomainRule {\\n  id: string;\\n  domain: string;\\n  enabled: boolean;\\n  source: \'default\' | \'suggested\' | \'custom\';\\n  description: string;\\n  hitCount: number;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface TelemetrySuggestion {\\n  domain: string;\\n  description: string;\\n  module: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface SystemPackageItem {\\n  packageName: string;\\n  appName: string;\\n  category: \'MIUI Security & Core\' | \'Xiaomi Telemetry & Ads\' | \'H\341\273\207 th\341\273\221ng Android\';\\n  description: string;\\n  selected: boolean;\\n  uid: number;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface DnsLogEntry {\\n  id: string;\\n  timestamp: string;\\n  domain: string;\\n  packageName: string;\\n  appName: string;\\n  status: \'BLOCKED\' | \'FORWARDED\' | \'BYPASSED\';\\n  resolvedIp: string;\\n  latencyMs: number;\\n  queryType: \'A\' | \'AAAA\';\\n}\\n\\nexport const INITIAL_BLOCK_RULES: DomainRule[] = [\\n  {\\n    id: \'rule-1\',\\n    domain: \'fraud-detection.engine.miui.com\',\\n    enabled: true,\\n    source: \'default\',\\n    description: \'Ki\341\273\203m tra b\341\272\243o m\341\272\255t & x\303\241c th\341\273\261c thi\341\272\277t b\341\273\213 ng\341\272\247m c\341\273\247a MIUI Security\',\\n    hitCount: 42,\\n  },\\n  {\\n    id: \'rule-2\',\\n    domain: \'flash.sec.miui.com\',\\n    enabled: true,\\n    source: \'default\',\\n    description: \'Ki\341\273\203m tra tr\341\272\241ng th\303\241i \321\200\320\260\320\267\320\261\320\273\320\276\320\272\320\270\321\200\320\276\320\262\320\272\320\270 /\345\210\267\346\234\272 (Unlock Bootloader & Flash)\',\\n    hitCount: 19,\\n  },\\n  {\\n    id: \'rule-3\',\\n    domain: \'dm.wo.com.cn\',\\n    enabled: true,\\n    source: \'default\',\\n    description: \'M\303\241y ch\341\273\247 qu\341\272\243n l\303\275 thi\341\272\277t b\341\273\213 nh\303\240 m\341\272\241ng n\341\273\231i \304\221\341\273\213a (Device Management)\',\\n    hitCount: 14,\\n  },\\n  {\\n    id: \'rule-4\',\\n    domain: \'data.mistat.xiaomi.com\',\\n    enabled: true,\\n    source: \'default\',\\n    description: \'Thu th\341\272\255p s\341\273\221 li\341\273\207u th\341\273\221ng k\303\252 h\303\240nh vi & nh\341\272\255t k\303\275 s\341\273\255 d\341\273\245ng Xiaomi\',\\n    hitCount: 87,\\n  },\\n  {\\n    id: \'rule-5\',\\n    domain: \'tracking.miui.com\',\\n    enabled: true,\\n    source: \'default\',\\n    description: \'H\341\273\207 th\341\273\221ng theo d\303\265i s\341\273\261 ki\341\273\207n h\341\273\207 th\341\273\221ng & ph\303\242n t\303\255ch MIUI\',\\n    hitCount: 63,\\n  },\\n];\\n\\nexport const MIUI_TELEMETRY_SUGGESTIONS: TelemetrySuggestion[] = [\\n  {\\n    domain: \'data.mistat.intl.xiaomi.com\',\\n    description: \'M\303\241y ch\341\273\247 thu th\341\272\255p th\341\273\221ng k\303\252 MIUI/HyperOS b\341\272\243n Qu\341\273\221c t\341\272\277\',\\n    module: \'MiStat Analytics\',\\n  },\\n  {\\n    domain: \'tracking.intl.miui.com\',\\n    description: \'\304\220i\341\273\203m cu\341\273\221i theo d\303\265i nh\341\272\255t k\303\275 ho\341\272\241t \304\221\341\273\231ng ROM Qu\341\273\221c t\341\272\277\',\\n    module: \'MIUI Analytics\',\\n  },\\n  {\\n    domain: \'api.ad.xiaomi.com\',\\n    description: \'Ph\303\242n ph\341\273\221i qu\341\272\243ng c\303\241o h\341\273\207 th\341\273\221ng trong \341\273\251ng d\341\273\245ng m\341\272\267c \304\221\341\273\213nh\',\\n    module: \'MSA (MIUI System Ads)\',\\n  },\\n  {\\n    domain: \'sdkconfig.ad.xiaomi.com\',\\n    description: \'T\341\272\243i c\341\272\245u h\303\254nh SDK qu\341\272\243ng c\303\241o \304\221\341\273\231ng tr\303\252n thi\341\272\277t b\341\273\213 Xiaomi\',\\n    module: \'MSA SDK\',\\n  },\\n  {\\n    domain: \'ccc.sys.miui.com\',\\n    description: \'\304\220\341\273\223ng b\341\273\231 ch\303\255nh s\303\241ch ki\341\273\203m so\303\241t \304\221\303\241m m\303\242y c\341\273\247a h\341\273\207 th\341\273\221ng MIUI\',\\n    module: \'Cloud Control\',\\n  },\\n  {\\n    domain: \'abtest.mistat.xiaomi.com\',\\n    description: \'Theo d\303\265i th\341\273\255 nghi\341\273\207m A/B t\303\255nh n\304\203ng ng\341\272\247m tr\303\252n thi\341\272\277t b\341\273\213\',\\n    module: \'MiStat A/B\',\\n  },\\n  {\\n    domain: \'metok.sys.miui.com\',\\n    description: \'\304\220\341\273\213nh v\341\273\213 tr\341\272\241m thu ph\303\241t v\303\240 thu th\341\272\255p th\303\264ng tin m\341\272\241ng ng\341\272\247m\',\\n    module: \'Metok NLP\',\\n  },\\n  {\\n    domain: \'sec-cdn.static.xiaomi.net\',\\n    description: \'T\341\272\243i danh s\303\241ch \304\221en ki\341\273\203m duy\341\273\207t \341\273\251ng d\341\273\245ng c\303\240i \304\221\341\272\267t ngo\303\240i\',\\n    module: \'MIUI Guard\',\\n  },\\n];\\n\\nexport const INITIAL_SYSTEM_PACKAGES: SystemPackageItem[] = [\\n  {\\n    packageName: \'com.miui.securitycenter\',\\n    appName: \'B\341\272\243o m\341\272\255t MIUI (Security Center)\',\\n    category: \'MIUI Security & Core\',\\n    description: \'G\341\273\255i truy v\341\272\245n t\341\273\233i fraud-detection.engine.miui.com v\303\240 flash.sec.miui.com\',\\n    selected: true,\\n    uid: 1000,\\n  },\\n  {\\n    packageName: \'com.miui.analytics\',\\n    appName: \'MIUI Analytics\',\\n    category: \'Xiaomi Telemetry & Ads\',\\n    description: \'D\341\273\213ch v\341\273\245 thu th\341\272\255p d\341\273\257 li\341\273\207u ch\341\272\251n \304\221o\303\241n v\303\240 g\341\273\255i v\341\273\201 tracking.miui.com\',\\n    selected: true,\\n    uid: 10042,\\n  },\\n  {\\n    packageName: \'com.miui.daemon\',\\n    appName: \'MIUI Daemon\',\\n    category: \'Xiaomi Telemetry & Ads\',\\n    description: \'Ti\341\272\277n tr\303\254nh n\341\273\201n thu th\341\272\255p th\341\273\221ng k\303\252 hi\341\273\207u n\304\203ng g\341\273\255i v\341\273\201 data.mistat.xiaomi.com\',\\n    selected: true,\\n    uid: 10045,\\n  },\\n  {\\n    packageName: \'com.miui.msa.global\',\\n    appName: \'MSA (MIUI System Ads)\',\\n    category: \'Xiaomi Telemetry & Ads\',\\n    description: \'D\341\273\213ch v\341\273\245 qu\341\272\243ng c\303\241o h\341\273\207 th\341\273\221ng v\303\240 theo d\303\265i hi\341\273\203n th\341\273\213\',\\n    selected: true,\\n    uid: 10051,\\n  },\\n  {\\n    packageName: \'com.xiaomi.joyose\',\\n    appName: \'Joyose\',\\n    category: \'MIUI Security & Core\',\\n    description: \'Qu\341\272\243n l\303\275 c\341\272\245u h\303\254nh \304\221\303\241m m\303\242y, gi\341\273\233i h\341\272\241n hi\341\273\207u n\304\203ng v\303\240 d\341\273\213ch v\341\273\245 nh\303\240 m\341\272\241ng\',\\n    selected: true,\\n    uid: 10058,\\n  },\\n  {\\n    packageName: \'com.xiaomi.finddevice\',\\n    appName: \'T\303\254m thi\341\272\277t b\341\273\213 & X\303\241c th\341\273\261c SIM\',\\n    category: \'MIUI Security & Core\',\\n    description: \'Ki\341\273\203m tra tr\341\272\241ng th\303\241i kh\303\263a thi\341\272\277t b\341\273\213 v\303\240 k\341\272\277t n\341\273\221i dm.wo.com.cn\',\\n    selected: true,\\n    uid: 10063,\\n  },\\n  {\\n    packageName: \'com.miui.guardprovider\',\\n    appName: \'MIUI Guard Provider\',\\n    category: \'MIUI Security & Core\',\\n    description: \'Qu\303\251t c\303\240i \304\221\341\272\267t APK v\303\240 \304\221\341\273\221i chi\341\272\277u m\303\241y ch\341\273\247 ki\341\273\203m duy\341\273\207t MIUI\',\\n    selected: true,\\n    uid: 10070,\\n  },\\n  {\\n    packageName: \'com.android.updater\',\\n    appName: \'Tr\303\254nh c\341\272\255p nh\341\272\255t h\341\273\207 th\341\273\221ng\',\\n    category: \'MIUI Security & Core\',\\n    description: \'Ki\341\273\203m tra b\341\272\243n c\341\272\255p nh\341\272\255t OTA v\303\240 x\303\241c th\341\273\261c ROM\',\\n    selected: false,\\n    uid: 10012,\\n  },\\n  {\\n    packageName: \'com.google.android.gms\',\\n    appName: \'D\341\273\213ch v\341\273\245 c\341\273\247a Google Play\',\\n    category: \'H\341\273\207 th\341\273\221ng Android\',\\n    description: \'D\341\273\213ch v\341\273\245 n\341\273\201n t\341\272\243ng Google, th\303\264ng b\303\241o \304\221\341\272\251y FCM v\303\240 \304\221\341\273\223ng b\341\273\231 t\303\240i kho\341\272\243n\',\\n    selected: false,\\n    uid: 10088,\\n  },\\n  {\\n    packageName: \'com.android.vending\',\\n    appName: \'C\341\273\255a h\303\240ng Google Play\',\\n    category: \'H\341\273\207 th\341\273\221ng Android\',\\n    description: \'T\341\272\243i xu\341\273\221ng v\303\240 c\341\272\255p nh\341\272\255t \341\273\251ng d\341\273\245ng t\341\273\253 Google Play\',\\n    selected: false,\\n    uid: 10089,\\n  },\\n];\\n\\nexport const SAMPLE_SAFE_DOMAINS: Array<{ domain: string; packageName: string; appName: string }> = [\\n  {\\n    domain: \'connectivitycheck.gstatic.com\',\\n    packageName: \'com.google.android.gms\',\\n    appName: \'D\341\273\213ch v\341\273\245 c\341\273\247a Google Play\',\\n  },\\n  {\\n    domain: \'time.android.com\',\\n    packageName: \'com.miui.securitycenter\',\\n    appName: \'B\341\272\243o m\341\272\255t MIUI (Security Center)\',\\n  },\\n  {\\n    domain: \'account.xiaomi.com\',\\n    packageName: \'com.xiaomi.finddevice\',\\n    appName: \'T\303\254m thi\341\272\277t b\341\273\213 & X\303\241c th\341\273\261c SIM\',\\n  },\\n  {\\n    domain: \'play.googleapis.com\',\\n    packageName: \'com.android.vending\',\\n    appName: \'C\341\273\255a h\303\240ng Google Play\',\\n  },\\n  {\\n    domain: \'api.sec.miui.com\',\\n    packageName: \'com.miui.guardprovider\',\\n    appName: \'MIUI Guard Provider\',\\n  },\\n  {\\n    domain: \'cloud.xiaomi.com\',\\n    packageName: \'com.xiaomi.joyose\',\\n    appName: \'Joyose\',\\n  },\\n];\\n\",\"Description\":\"Create default Xiaomi/MIUI block rules, telemetry suggestions, and system package definitions\",\"Overwrite\":true,\"TargetFile\":\"/src/data/vpnDefaults.ts\",\"toolAction\":\"Creating VPN default data\",\"toolSummary\":\"Create default block rules and system packages in vpnDefaults.ts\"}"
