  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Crafting `/src/App.tsx`**\n\nI\'m now deep in the process of building `/src/App.tsx`, focusing intently on visual minimalism and impeccable typography. Ergonomics and intuitive single-line controls are paramount, with working handlers for every interactive element being a core focus. Metadata is being handled without resorting to clunky static pill enclosures.\n\n\n**Reviewing App Features**\n\nI\'m currently reviewing all features in `/src/App.tsx`, concentrating on the top bar contract, sub-header workspace toolbar, and core views. I\'ve defined three zones in the top bar with specific elements, including a wordmark, navigation links, and a primary action button. The sub-header workspace includes quick switchers for DNS resolvers and themes, alongside a reset/export button. I\'m focusing on responsiveness and multi-column layouts.\n\n\n**Designing VPN Interface**\n\nI\'m currently designing the VPN control center\'s interface within `/src/App.tsx`. I\'m focusing on a tactile, one-tap VPN power switch with a live session timer and TUN interface IP. Real-time KPI summary cards will display DNS queries, blocked requests, and active block rules, and I\'m designing quick blocklist status overview, for the five core Xiaomi domains. I\'m exploring tabbed navigation for quick access on larger screens, with a mobile-friendly bottom navigation bar.\n\n\n**Developing DNS Tools**\n\nI\'m now deep in designing two new tabs for the VPN interface. I\'m focusing on Tab 2, the DNS logs, specifically crafting the interactive DNS lookup bar, the real-time filter controls, and the clean metadata display. I am creating a system that allows instant domain testing. For Tab 3, I am designing a custom blocklist view to provide easy-to-use toggle switches.\n\n\n**Implementing Blocklist Rules**\n\nI\'m now implementing the manual rule form, ensuring it handles `0.0.0.0 domain.com` and `domain.com` formats (with multi-line paste support) and validates/normalizes the input. I\'m focusing on the filter controls for the blocklist, allowing users to toggle between different states. Furthermore, I\'ve added enable/disable switches and delete buttons for custom rules. Also, I am curating a list of Xiaomi/MIUI telemetry endpoints for a one-tap blocklist addition.\n\n**Tab 4 Design Underway**\n\nI am now focusing on Tab 4: the Per-App VPN Package Selector. I am making it a dual-mode selector as requested. I\'m focusing on two modes, one which filters the selected packages, allowing the chosen packages to use the VPN.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_229850"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"/**\\n * @license\\n * SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0\\n */\\n\\nimport React, { useEffect, useMemo, useState } from \'react\';\\nimport {\\n  Activity,\\n  Check,\\n  Code2,\\n  Copy,\\n  Download,\\n  Filter,\\n  Globe,\\n  Layers,\\n  Moon,\\n  Pause,\\n  Play,\\n  Plus,\\n  Power,\\n  RefreshCw,\\n  Search,\\n  Shield,\\n  ShieldAlert,\\n  ShieldCheck,\\n  Sparkles,\\n  Sun,\\n  Terminal,\\n  Trash2,\\n  X,\\n} from \'lucide-react\';\\nimport {\\n  AppFilterMode,\\n  DnsLogEntry,\\n  DnsUpstream,\\n  DomainRule,\\n  INITIAL_BLOCK_RULES,\\n  INITIAL_SYSTEM_PACKAGES,\\n  MIUI_TELEMETRY_SUGGESTIONS,\\n  SAMPLE_SAFE_DOMAINS,\\n  SystemPackageItem,\\n} from \'./data/vpnDefaults\';\\nimport {\\n  generateAndroidManifestXml,\\n  generateHostsFileContent,\\n  generateKotlinVpnServiceCode,\\n} from \'./utils/kotlinGenerator\';\\n\\ntype ActiveTab = \'dashboard\' | \'logs\' | \'blocklist\' | \'packages\';\\ntype CodeTab = \'kotlin\' | \'hosts\' | \'manifest\';\\n\\nconst STORAGE_KEYS = {\\n  RULES: \'miguard_dns_rules_v1\',\\n  PACKAGES: \'miguard_dns_packages_v1\',\\n  UPSTREAM: \'miguard_dns_upstream_v1\',\\n  FILTER_MODE: \'miguard_dns_filter_mode_v1\',\\n  THEME: \'miguard_dns_theme_v1\',\\n};\\n\\nfunction formatTimeNow(): string {\\n  const now = new Date();\\n  const h = String(now.getHours()).padStart(2, \'0\');\\n  const m = String(now.getMinutes()).padStart(2, \'0\');\\n  const s = String(now.getSeconds()).padStart(2, \'0\');\\n  return `${h}:${m}:${s}`;\\n}\\n\\nfunction formatDuration(seconds: number): string {\\n  const hrs = Math.floor(seconds / 3600);\\n  const mins = Math.floor((seconds % 3600) / 60);\\n  const secs = seconds % 60;\\n  return [hrs, mins, secs].map((v) => String(v).padStart(2, \'0\')).join(\':\');\\n}\\n\\nfunction normalizeDomainInput(raw: string): string {\\n  const cleaned = raw\\n    .trim()\\n    .toLowerCase()\\n    .replace(/^0\\\\.0\\\\.0\\\\.0\\\\s+/, \'\')\\n    .replace(/^127\\\\.0\\\\.0\\\\.1\\\\s+/, \'\')\\n    .replace(/^https?:\\\\/\\\\//, \'\')\\n    .split(\'/\')[0]\\n    .split(\'#\')[0]\\n    .trim();\\n  return cleaned;\\n}\\n\\nexport default function App() {\\n  // Theme state synced with <html class=\\\"dark\\\">\\n  const [isDark, setIsDark] = useState<boolean>(() => {\\n    const saved = localStorage.getItem(STORAGE_KEYS.THEME);\\n    return saved ? saved === \'dark\' : true;\\n  });\\n\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    const root = document.documentElement;\\n    if (isDark) {\\n      root.classList.add(\'dark\');\\n    } else {\\n      root.classList.remove(\'dark\');\\n    }\\n    localStorage.setItem(STORAGE_KEYS.THEME, isDark ? \'dark\' : \'light\');\\n  }, [isDark]);\\n\\n  // Navigation & Modal State\\n  const [activeTab, setActiveTab] = useState<ActiveTab>(\'dashboard\');\\n  const [showCodeModal, setShowCodeModal] = useState<boolean>(false);\\n  const [activeCodeTab, setActiveCodeTab] = useState<CodeTab>(\'kotlin\');\\n  const [copiedFeedback, setCopiedFeedback] = useState<string | null>(null);\\n\\n  // Core VPN State\\n  const [vpnConnected, setVpnConnected] = useState<boolean>(true);\\n  const [uptimeSeconds, setUptimeSeconds] = useState<number>(854);\\n  const [primaryDns, setPrimaryDns] = useState<DnsUpstream>(() => {\\n    const saved = localStorage.getItem(STORAGE_KEYS.UPSTREAM);\\n    return saved === \'8.8.8.8\' ? \'8.8.8.8\' : \'1.1.1.1\';\\n  });\\n\\n  const secondaryDns: DnsUpstream = primaryDns === \'1.1.1.1\' ? \'8.8.8.8\' : \'1.1.1.1\';\\n\\n  // Blocklist Rules State\\n  const [rules, setRules] = useState<DomainRule[]>(() => {\\n    try {\\n      const saved = localStorage.getItem(STORAGE_KEYS.RULES);\\n      if (saved) {\\n        const parsed = JSON.parse(saved);\\n        if (Array.isArray(parsed) && parsed.length > 0) return parsed;\\n      }\\n    } catch {\\n      // ignore parse errors\\n    }\\n    return INITIAL_BLOCK_RULES;\\n  });\\n\\n  // Per-App System Packages State\\n  const [filterMode, setFilterMode] = useState<AppFilterMode>(() => {\\n    const saved = localStorage.getItem(STORAGE_KEYS.FILTER_MODE);\\n    return saved === \'blocklist\' ? \'blocklist\' : \'allowlist\';\\n  });\\n\\n  const [packages, setPackages] = useState<SystemPackageItem[]>(() => {\\n    try {\\n      const saved = localStorage.getItem(STORAGE_KEYS.PACKAGES);\\n      if (saved) {\\n        const parsed = JSON.parse(saved);\\n        if (Array.isArray(parsed) && parsed.length > 0) return parsed;\\n      }\\n    } catch {\\n      // ignore\\n    }\\n    return INITIAL_SYSTEM_PACKAGES;\\n  });\\n\\n  // Persist user settings\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    localStorage.setItem(STORAGE_KEYS.RULES, JSON.stringify(rules));\\n  }, [rules]);\\n\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    localStorage.setItem(STORAGE_KEYS.PACKAGES, JSON.stringify(packages));\\n  }, [packages]);\\n\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    localStorage.setItem(STORAGE_KEYS.UPSTREAM, primaryDns);\\n  }, [primaryDns]);\\n\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    localStorage.setItem(STORAGE_KEYS.FILTER_MODE, filterMode);\\n  }, [filterMode]);\\n\\n  // Real-time Connection Logs State\\n  const [logs, setLogs] = useState<DnsLogEntry[]>(() => [\\n    {\\n      id: \'init-1\',\\n      timestamp: formatTimeNow(),\\n      domain: \'fraud-detection.engine.miui.com\',\\n      packageName: \'com.miui.securitycenter\',\\n      appName: \'B\341\272\243o m\341\272\255t MIUI (Security Center)\',\\n      status: \'BLOCKED\',\\n      resolvedIp: \'0.0.0.0\',\\n      latencyMs: 1,\\n      queryType: \'A\',\\n    },\\n    {\\n      id: \'init-2\',\\n      timestamp: formatTimeNow(),\\n      domain: \'data.mistat.xiaomi.com\',\\n      packageName: \'com.miui.daemon\',\\n      appName: \'MIUI Daemon\',\\n      status: \'BLOCKED\',\\n      resolvedIp: \'0.0.0.0\',\\n      latencyMs: 1,\\n      queryType: \'A\',\\n    },\\n    {\\n      id: \'init-3\',\\n      timestamp: formatTimeNow(),\\n      domain: \'connectivitycheck.gstatic.com\',\\n      packageName: \'com.google.android.gms\',\\n      appName: \'D\341\273\213ch v\341\273\245 c\341\273\247a Google Play\',\\n      status: \'FORWARDED\',\\n      resolvedIp: \'1.1.1.1\',\\n      latencyMs: 18,\\n      queryType: \'A\',\\n    },\\n    {\\n      id: \'init-4\',\\n      timestamp: formatTimeNow(),\\n      domain: \'flash.sec.miui.com\',\\n      packageName: \'com.miui.securitycenter\',\\n      appName: \'B\341\272\243o m\341\272\255t MIUI (Security Center)\',\\n      status: \'BLOCKED\',\\n      resolvedIp: \'0.0.0.0\',\\n      latencyMs: 1,\\n      queryType: \'A\',\\n    },\\n    {\\n      id: \'init-5\',\\n      timestamp: formatTimeNow(),\\n      domain: \'tracking.miui.com\',\\n      packageName: \'com.miui.analytics\',\\n      appName: \'MIUI Analytics\',\\n      status: \'BLOCKED\',\\n      resolvedIp: \'0.0.0.0\',\\n      latencyMs: 1,\\n      queryType: \'A\',\\n    },\\n    {\\n      id: \'init-6\',\\n      timestamp: formatTimeNow(),\\n      domain: \'dm.wo.com.cn\',\\n      packageName: \'com.xiaomi.finddevice\',\\n      appName: \'T\303\254m thi\341\272\277t b\341\273\213 & X\303\241c th\341\273\261c SIM\',\\n      status: \'BLOCKED\',\\n      resolvedIp: \'0.0.0.0\',\\n      latencyMs: 1,\\n      queryType: \'A\',\\n    },\\n  ]);\\n\\n  const [streamPaused, setStreamPaused] = useState<boolean>(false);\\n  const [logFilter, setLogFilter] = useState<\'ALL\' | \'BLOCKED\' | \'FORWARDED\'>(\'ALL\');\\n  const [logSearch, setLogSearch] = useState<string>(\'\');\\n\\n  // Custom Blocklist Input State\\n  const [newDomainInput, setNewDomainInput] = useState<string>(\'\');\\n  const [newDomainDesc, setNewDomainDesc] = useState<string>(\'\');\\n  const [domainInputError, setDomainInputError] = useState<string | null>(null);\\n  const [ruleSearch, setRuleSearch] = useState<string>(\'\');\\n  const [ruleFilter, setRuleFilter] = useState<\'all\' | \'default\' | \'enabled\' | \'disabled\'>(\'all\');\\n\\n  // Package Filter UI State\\n  const [pkgSearch, setPkgSearch] = useState<string>(\'\');\\n  const [pkgCategoryFilter, setPkgCategoryFilter] = useState<string>(\'ALL\');\\n\\n  // Test DNS Query UI State\\n  const [testDomain, setTestDomain] = useState<string>(\'fraud-detection.engine.miui.com\');\\n  const [testPackage, setTestPackage] = useState<string>(\'com.miui.securitycenter\');\\n\\n  // Uptime Counter\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    if (!vpnConnected) return;\\n    const timer = window.setInterval(() => {\\n      setUptimeSeconds((prev) => prev + 1);\\n    }, 1000);\\n    return () => window.clearInterval(timer);\\n  }, [vpnConnected]);\\n\\n  // Helper: Check if a package is routed through VPN based on Per-App mode\\n  const isPackageRoutedInVpn = (pkgName: string): boolean => {\\n    const pkg = packages.find((p) => p.packageName === pkgName);\\n    if (!pkg) return true;\\n    if (filterMode === \'allowlist\') {\\n      return pkg.selected;\\n    } else {\\n      return !pkg.selected;\\n    }\\n  };\\n\\n  // Helper: Evaluate a DNS request against active rules and Per-App filter\\n  const evaluateDnsQuery = (domainInput: string, packageName: string) => {\\n    const cleanDomain = normalizeDomainInput(domainInput);\\n    const pkgObj = packages.find((p) => p.packageName === packageName);\\n    const appName = pkgObj ? pkgObj.appName : packageName;\\n\\n    const routedToVpn = isPackageRoutedInVpn(packageName);\\n\\n    if (!routedToVpn) {\\n      const entry: DnsLogEntry = {\\n        id: `log-${Date.now()}-${Math.random().toString(36).slice(2, 6)}`,\\n        timestamp: formatTimeNow(),\\n        domain: cleanDomain,\\n        packageName,\\n        appName,\\n        status: \'BYPASSED\',\\n        resolvedIp: `Tr\341\273\261c ti\341\272\277p (B\341\273\217 qua VPN)`,\\n        latencyMs: 22,\\n        queryType: \'A\',\\n      };\\n      setLogs((prev) => [entry, ...prev.slice(0, 149)]);\\n      return;\\n    }\\n\\n    const matchedRule = rules.find(\\n      (r) =>\\n        r.enabled &&\\n        (cleanDomain === r.domain || cleanDomain.endsWith(`.${r.domain}`))\\n    );\\n\\n    if (matchedRule) {\\n      setRules((prev) =>\\n        prev.map((r) =>\\n          r.id === matchedRule.id ? { ...r, hitCount: r.hitCount + 1 } : r\\n        )\\n      );\\n      const entry: DnsLogEntry = {\\n        id: `log-${Date.now()}-${Math.random().toString(36).slice(2, 6)}`,\\n        timestamp: formatTimeNow(),\\n        domain: cleanDomain,\\n        packageName,\\n        appName,\\n        status: \'BLOCKED\',\\n        resolvedIp: \'0.0.0.0\',\\n        latencyMs: 1,\\n        queryType: \'A\',\\n      };\\n      setLogs((prev) => [entry, ...prev.slice(0, 149)]);\\n    } else {\\n      const simulatedLatency = primaryDns === \'1.1.1.1\' ? Math.floor(11 + Math.random() * 14) : Math.floor(16 + Math.random() * 18);\\n      const entry: DnsLogEntry = {\\n        id: `log-${Date.now()}-${Math.random().toString(36).slice(2, 6)}`,\\n        timestamp: formatTimeNow(),\\n        domain: cleanDomain,\\n        packageName,\\n        appName,\\n        status: \'FORWARDED\',\\n        resolvedIp: primaryDns,\\n        latencyMs: simulatedLatency,\\n        queryType: \'A\',\\n      };\\n      setLogs((prev) => [entry, ...prev.slice(0, 149)]);\\n    }\\n  };\\n\\n  // Real-time background DNS traffic simulation when VPN is active\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    if (!vpnConnected || streamPaused) return;\\n\\n    const interval = window.setInterval(() => {\\n      const shouldSimulateTelemetry = Math.random() < 0.62;\\n      if (shouldSimulateTelemetry && rules.length > 0) {\\n        const randomRule = rules[Math.floor(Math.random() * rules.length)];\\n        const miuiPackages = [\\n          \'com.miui.securitycenter\',\\n          \'com.miui.analytics\',\\n          \'com.miui.daemon\',\\n          \'com.xiaomi.finddevice\',\\n          \'com.miui.msa.global\',\\n        ];\\n        const pkg = miuiPackages[Math.floor(Math.random() * miuiPackages.length)];\\n        evaluateDnsQuery(randomRule.domain, pkg);\\n      } else {\\n        const sample =\\n          SAMPLE_SAFE_DOMAINS[Math.floor(Math.random() * SAMPLE_SAFE_DOMAINS.length)];\\n        evaluateDnsQuery(sample.domain, sample.packageName);\\n      }\\n    }, 2600);\\n\\n    return () => window.clearInterval(interval);\\n  }, [vpnConnected, streamPaused, rules, primaryDns, packages, filterMode]);\\n\\n  // Derived Statistics\\n  const stats = useMemo(() => {\\n    const totalBlockedHits = rules.reduce((acc, r) => acc + r.hitCount, 0);\\n    const forwardedLogsCount = logs.filter((l) => l.status !== \'BLOCKED\').length + 148;\\n    const totalQueries = totalBlockedHits + forwardedLogsCount;\\n    const blockRate =\\n      totalQueries > 0 ? Math.round((totalBlockedHits / totalQueries) * 100) : 0;\\n    const enabledRulesCount = rules.filter((r) => r.enabled).length;\\n    const selectedPackagesCount = packages.filter((p) => p.selected).length;\\n\\n    return {\\n      totalBlockedHits,\\n      totalQueries,\\n      blockRate,\\n      enabledRulesCount,\\n      selectedPackagesCount,\\n    };\\n  }, [rules, logs, packages]);\\n\\n  // Filtered Logs\\n  const filteredLogs = useMemo(() => {\\n    return logs.filter((entry) => {\\n      if (logFilter === \'BLOCKED\' && entry.status !== \'BLOCKED\') return false;\\n      if (logFilter === \'FORWARDED\' && entry.status === \'BLOCKED\') return false;\\n      if (logSearch.trim()) {\\n        const q = logSearch.toLowerCase();\\n        return (\\n          entry.domain.toLowerCase().includes(q) ||\\n          entry.packageName.toLowerCase().includes(q) ||\\n          entry.appName.toLowerCase().includes(q)\\n        );\\n      }\\n      return true;\\n    });\\n  }, [logs, logFilter, logSearch]);\\n\\n  // Filtered Rules\\n  const filteredRules = useMemo(() => {\\n    return rules.filter((rule) => {\\n      if (ruleFilter === \'default\' && rule.source !== \'default\') return false;\\n      if (ruleFilter === \'enabled\' && !rule.enabled) return false;\\n      if (ruleFilter === \'disabled\' && rule.enabled) return false;\\n      if (ruleSearch.trim()) {\\n        const q = ruleSearch.toLowerCase();\\n        return (\\n          rule.domain.toLowerCase().includes(q) ||\\n          rule.description.toLowerCase().includes(q)\\n        );\\n      }\\n      return true;\\n    });\\n  }, [rules, ruleFilter, ruleSearch]);\\n\\n  // Remaining Xiaomi/MIUI Suggestions (not yet in rules)\\n  const availableSuggestions = useMemo(() => {\\n    const existingSet = new Set(rules.map((r) => r.domain.toLowerCase()));\\n    return MIUI_TELEMETRY_SUGGESTIONS.filter(\\n      (s) => !existingSet.has(s.domain.toLowerCase())\\n    );\\n  }, [rules]);\\n\\n  // Filtered Packages\\n  const filteredPackages = useMemo(() => {\\n    return packages.filter((pkg) => {\\n      if (pkgCategoryFilter !== \'ALL\' && pkg.category !== pkgCategoryFilter) {\\n        return false;\\n      }\\n      if (pkgSearch.trim()) {\\n        const q = pkgSearch.toLowerCase();\\n        return (\\n          pkg.packageName.toLowerCase().includes(q) ||\\n          pkg.appName.toLowerCase().includes(q) ||\\n          pkg.description.toLowerCase().includes(q)\\n        );\\n      }\\n      return true;\\n    });\\n  }, [packages, pkgCategoryFilter, pkgSearch]);\\n\\n  // Handlers\\n  const handleAddCustomDomain = (e: React.FormEvent) => {\\n    e.preventDefault();\\n    setDomainInputError(null);\\n\\n    const lines = newDomainInput\\n      .split(/[\\\\n,;]+/)\\n      .map((l) => normalizeDomainInput(l))\\n      .filter(Boolean);\\n\\n    if (lines.length === 0) {\\n      setDomainInputError(\'Vui l\303\262ng nh\341\272\255p t\303\252n mi\341\273\201n h\341\273\243p l\341\273\207 (v\303\255 d\341\273\245: 0.0.0.0 tracking.miui.com).\');\\n      return;\\n    }\\n\\n    const domainRegex = /^[a-z0-9]+([\\\\-\\\\.]{1}[a-z0-9]+)*\\\\.[a-z]{2,}$/i;\\n    const invalidLine = lines.find((d) => !domainRegex.test(d));\\n    if (invalidLine) {\\n      setDomainInputError(`\304\220\341\273\213nh d\341\272\241ng t\303\252n mi\341\273\201n kh\303\264ng h\341\273\243p l\341\273\207: \\\"${invalidLine}\\\"`);\\n      return;\\n    }\\n\\n    const existingDomains = new Set(rules.map((r) => r.domain));\\n    const newItems: DomainRule[] = [];\\n\\n    lines.forEach((domain) => {\\n      if (!existingDomains.has(domain)) {\\n        existingDomains.add(domain);\\n        newItems.push({\\n          id: `custom-${Date.now()}-${Math.random().toString(36).slice(2, 6)}`,\\n          domain,\\n          enabled: true,\\n          source: \'custom\',\\n          description:\\n            newDomainDesc.trim() || \'Quy t\341\272\257c ch\341\272\267n t\303\271y ch\341\273\211nh do ng\306\260\341\273\235i d\303\271ng th\303\252m (0.0.0.0)\',\\n          hitCount: 0,\\n        });\\n      }\\n    });\\n\\n    if (newItems.length === 0) {\\n      setDomainInputError(\'T\303\252n mi\341\273\201n n\303\240y \304\221\303\243 c\303\263 trong danh s\303\241ch ch\341\272\267n.\');\\n      return;\\n    }\\n\\n    setRules((prev) => [...newItems, ...prev]);\\n    setNewDomainInput(\'\');\\n    setNewDomainDesc(\'\');\\n  };\\n\\n  const handleAddSuggestion = (domain: string, description: string) => {\\n    if (rules.some((r) => r.domain === domain)) return;\\n    const newRule: DomainRule = {\\n      id: `sug-${Date.now()}-${Math.random().toString(36).slice(2, 5)}`,\\n      domain,\\n      enabled: true,\\n      source: \'suggested\',\\n      description,\\n      hitCount: 0,\\n    };\\n    setRules((prev) => [newRule, ...prev]);\\n  };\\n\\n  const handleAddAllSuggestions = () => {\\n    const newRules: DomainRule[] = availableSuggestions.map((s, idx) => ({\\n      id: `sug-batch-${Date.now()}-${idx}`,\\n      domain: s.domain,\\n      enabled: true,\\n      source: \'suggested\',\\n      description: `${s.module} \342\200\224 ${s.description}`,\\n      hitCount: 0,\\n    }));\\n    setRules((prev) => [...newRules, ...prev]);\\n  };\\n\\n  const handleToggleRule = (id: string) => {\\n    setRules((prev) =>\\n      prev.map((r) => (r.id === id ? { ...r, enabled: !r.enabled } : r))\\n    );\\n  };\\n\\n  const handleDeleteRule = (id: string) => {\\n    setRules((prev) => prev.filter((r) => r.id !== id));\\n  };\\n\\n  const handleResetDefaultRules = () => {\\n    setRules(INITIAL_BLOCK_RULES);\\n  };\\n\\n  const handleTogglePackage = (packageName: string) => {\\n    setPackages((prev) =>\\n      prev.map((p) =>\\n        p.packageName === packageName ? { ...p, selected: !p.selected } : p\\n      )\\n    );\\n  };\\n\\n  const handleSelectAllMiuiPackages = () => {\\n    setPackages((prev) =>\\n      prev.map((p) => ({\\n        ...p,\\n        selected:\\n          p.packageName.startsWith(\'com.miui.\') ||\\n          p.packageName.startsWith(\'com.xiaomi.\'),\\n      }))\\n    );\\n  };\\n\\n  const handleCopyText = (text: string, label: string) => {\\n    navigator.clipboard.writeText(text);\\n    setCopiedFeedback(label);\\n    window.setTimeout(() => setCopiedFeedback(null), 2000);\\n  };\\n\\n  const handleDownloadFile = (filename: string, content: string) => {\\n    const blob = new Blob([content], { type: \'text/plain;charset=utf-8\' });\\n    const url = URL.createObjectURL(blob);\\n    const a = document.createElement(\'a\');\\n    a.href = url;\\n    a.download = filename;\\n    a.click();\\n    URL.revokeObjectURL(url);\\n  };\\n\\n  const generatedKotlinCode = useMemo(\\n    () =>\\n      generateKotlinVpnServiceCode(\\n        rules,\\n        primaryDns,\\n        secondaryDns,\\n        filterMode,\\n        packages\\n      ),\\n    [rules, primaryDns, secondaryDns, filterMode, packages]\\n  );\\n\\n  const generatedHostsContent = useMemo(\\n    () => generateHostsFileContent(rules),\\n    [rules]\\n  );\\n\\n  const generatedManifestXml = useMemo(() => generateAndroidManifestXml(), []);\\n\\n  return (\\n    <div className=\\\"min-h-screen flex flex-col bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-950 text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 pb-20 lg:pb-10\\\">\\n      {/* TOP BAR CONTRACT: Strictly 3 zones separated by gap-8 */}\\n      <header className=\\\"sticky top-0 z-30 bg-white/90 dark:bg-slate-950/90 backdrop-blur-md border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\\\">\\n        <div className=\\\"max-w-7xl mx-auto flex items-center justify-between gap-8 px-4 sm:px-6 h-14\\\">\\n          {/* Zone 1: Single text element wordmark */}\\n          <a\\n            href=\\\"#top\\\"\\n            onClick={(e) => {\\n              e.preventDefault();\\n              setActiveTab(\'dashboard\');\\n            }}\\n            className=\\\"text-lg font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900 dark:text-white font-display whitespace-nowrap shrink-0\\\"\\n          >\\n            MiGuard DNS\\n          </a>\\n\\n          {/* Zone 2: 4 concise single-line navigation links */}\\n          <nav className=\\\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-6 text-sm font-medium text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400\\\">\\n            <button\\n              type=\\\"button\\\"\\n              onClick={() => setActiveTab(\'dashboard\')}\\n              className={`py-1 transition-colors whitespace-nowrap shrink-0 border-b-2 ${\\n                activeTab === \'dashboard\'\\n                  ? \'text-slate-900 dark:text-white border-emerald-500\'\\n                  : \'border-transparent hover:text-slate-900 dark:hover:text-white\'\\n              }`}\\n            >\\n              B\341\272\243ng \304\221i\341\273\201u khi\341\273\203n\\n            </button>\\n            <button\\n              type=\\\"button\\\"\\n              onClick={() => setActiveTab(\'logs\')}\\n              className={`py-1 transition-colors whitespace-nowrap shrink-0 border-b-2 ${\\n                activeTab === \'logs\'\\n                  ? \'text-slate-900 dark:text-white border-emerald-500\'\\n                  : \'border-transparent hover:text-slate-900 dark:hover:text-white\'\\n              }`}\\n            >\\n              Nh\341\272\255t k\303\275 k\341\272\277t n\341\273\221i\\n            </button>\\n            <button\\n              type=\\\"button\\\"\\n              onClick={() => setActiveTab(\'blocklist\')}\\n              className={`py-1 transition-colors whitespace-nowrap shrink-0 border-b-2 ${\\n                activeTab === \'blocklist\'\\n                  ? \'text-slate-900 dark:text-white border-emerald-500\'\\n                  : \'border-transparent hover:text-slate-900 dark:hover:text-white\'\\n              }`}\\n            >\\n              Danh s\303\241ch ch\341\272\267n\\n            </button>\\n            <button\\n              type=\\\"button\\\"\\n              onClick={() => setActiveTab(\'packages\')}\\n              className={`py-1 transition-colors whitespace-nowrap shrink-0 border-b-2 ${\\n                activeTab === \'packages\'\\n                  ? \'text-slate-900 dark:text-white border-emerald-500\'\\n                  : \'border-transparent hover:text-slate-900 dark:hover:text-white\'\\n              }`}\\n            >\\n              G\303\263i h\341\273\207 th\341\273\221ng\\n            </button>\\n          </nav>\\n\\n          {/* Zone 3: 1 primary action */}\\n          <div className=\\\"flex items-center shrink-0\\\">\\n            <button\\n              type=\\\"button\\\"\\n              onClick={() => setShowCodeModal(true)}\\n              className=\\\"min-h-[40px] px-4 py-2 text-xs font-medium text-white bg-emerald-600 hover:bg-emerald-500 rounded-lg transition-colors whitespace-nowrap shrink-0 flex items-center gap-2 cursor-pointer\\\"\\n            >\\n              <Code2 className=\\\"w-4 h-4\\\" />\\n              <span>M\303\243 ngu\341\273\223n Android</span>\\n            </button>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </header>\\n\\n      {/* Secondary Workspace Bar (DNS Selector, Status Metadata & Theme Switch) */}\\n      <div className=\\\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-900 bg-slate-100/60 dark:bg-slate-900/40\\\">\\n        <div className=\\\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-2.5 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 text-xs\\\">\\n          <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 font-mono\\\">\\n            <span>\\n              Tr\341\272\241ng th\303\241i: {vpnConnected ? \'\304\220ang b\341\272\243o v\341\273\207 (TUN 10.111.222.1)\' : \'\304\220\303\243 ng\341\272\257t k\341\272\277t n\341\273\221i\'}\\n            </span>\\n            <span aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\302\267</span>\\n            <span>Sinkhole: 0.0.0.0</span>\\n            <span aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\302\267</span>\\n            <span className=\\\"hidden sm:inline\\\">\\n              \304\220ang ch\341\272\267n {stats.enabledRulesCount} t\303\252n mi\341\273\201n\\n            </span>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-3\\\">\\n            {/* Segmented Upstream DNS Switcher */}\\n            <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-1 p-1 bg-slate-200/80 dark:bg-slate-800 rounded-lg\\\">\\n              <button\\n                type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                onClick={() => setPrimaryDns(\'1.1.1.1\')}\\n                className={`px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-mono font-medium rounded-md transition-colors whitespace-nowrap shrink-0 cursor-pointer ${\\n                  primaryDns === \'1.1.1.1\'\\n                    ? \'bg-white dark:bg-slate-950 text-slate-900 dark:text-emerald-400 shadow-xs\'\\n                    : \'text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-900 dark:hover:text-white\'\\n                }`}\\n              >\\n                DNS 1.1.1.1\\n              </button>\\n              <button\\n                type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                onClick={() => setPrimaryDns(\'8.8.8.8\')}\\n                className={`px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-mono font-medium rounded-md transition-colors whitespace-nowrap shrink-0 cursor-pointer ${\\n                  primaryDns === \'8.8.8.8\'\\n                    ? \'bg-white dark:bg-slate-950 text-slate-900 dark:text-emerald-400 shadow-xs\'\\n                    : \'text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-900 dark:hover:text-white\'\\n                }`}\\n              >\\n                DNS 8.8.8.8\\n              </button>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            {/* Theme Toggle */}\\n            <button\\n              type=\\\"button\\\"\\n              onClick={() => setIsDark((prev) => !prev)}\\n              aria-label=\\\"Chuy\341\273\203n \304\221\341\273\225i giao di\341\273\207n S\303\241ng / T\341\273\221i\\\"\\n              className=\\\"min-h-[36px] px-2.5 py-1.5 rounded-lg border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 hover:bg-slate-100 dark:hover:bg-slate-800 transition-colors flex items-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap shrink-0 cursor-pointer\\\"\\n            >\\n              {isDark ? <Sun className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5\\\" /> : <Moon className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5\\\" />}\\n              <span className=\\\"hidden sm:inline\\\">{isDark ? \'Giao di\341\273\207n S\303\241ng\' : \'Giao di\341\273\207n T\341\273\221i\'}</span>\\n            </button>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      {/* Main Content Container */}\\n      <main className=\\\"flex-1 max-w-7xl w-full mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-6\\\">\\n        <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-6 items-start\\\">\\n          {/* LEFT / PRIMARY INTERACTIVE WORKSPACE (7 columns on desktop) */}\\n          <div className=\\\"lg:col-span-7 space-y-6\\\">\\n            {/* TAB 1: DASHBOARD */}\\n            {activeTab === \'dashboard\' && (\\n              <>\\n                {/* Primary VPN Tunnel Control Card */}\\n                <section className=\\\"rounded-2xl bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 p-6\\\">\\n                  <div className=\\\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-6\\\">\\n                    <div className=\\\"space-y-2\\\">\\n                      <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 font-mono\\\">\\n                        <span>ANDROID VPNSERVICE</span>\\n                        <span aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\302\267</span>\\n                        <span>UDP PORT 53</span>\\n                        <span aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\302\267</span>\\n                        <span>{formatDuration(uptimeSeconds)}</span>\\n                      </div>\\n                      <h1 className=\\\"text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900 dark:text-white font-display\\\">\\n                        {vpnConnected\\n                          ? \'\304\220\306\260\341\273\235ng h\341\272\247m l\341\273\215c DNS \304\221ang b\341\272\255t\'\\n                          : \'\304\220\306\260\341\273\235ng h\341\272\247m l\341\273\215c DNS \304\221ang t\341\272\257t\'}\\n                      </h1>\\n                      <p className=\\\"text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 max-w-xl leading-relaxed\\\">\\n                        {vpnConnected\\n                          ? `\304\220ang ch\341\272\267n ${stats.enabledRulesCount} t\303\252n mi\341\273\201n Xiaomi/MIUI v\341\273\201 0.0.0.0 v\303\240 chuy\341\273\203n ti\341\272\277p m\341\273\215i truy v\341\272\245n h\341\273\243p l\341\273\207 kh\303\241c qua DNS ${primaryDns} (d\341\273\261 ph\303\262ng ${secondaryDns}).`\\n                          : \'B\341\272\245m n\303\272t ngu\341\273\223n \304\221\341\273\203 k\303\255ch ho\341\272\241t d\341\273\213ch v\341\273\245 VPN c\341\273\245c b\341\273\231. Kh\303\264ng s\341\273\255 d\341\273\245ng m\303\241y ch\341\273\247 trung gian, kh\303\264ng l\303\240m gi\341\272\243m t\341\273\221c \304\221\341\273\231 m\341\272\241ng.\'}\\n                      </p>\\n                    </div>\\n\\n                    {/* Tactile 1-Tap Connect Button */}\\n                    <div className=\\\"shrink-0 flex sm:flex-col items-center gap-3\\\">\\n                      <button\\n                        type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                        onClick={() => {\\n                          setVpnConnected((prev) => !prev);\\n                          if (!vpnConnected) setUptimeSeconds(0);\\n                        }}\\n                        className={`w-20 h-20 rounded-2xl flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-1 transition-transform active:scale-95 cursor-pointer border ${\\n                          vpnConnected\\n                            ? \'bg-emerald-600 hover:bg-emerald-500 text-white border-emerald-500 shadow-lg shadow-emerald-950/20\'\\n                            : \'bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-200 dark:hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-700\'\\n                        }`}\\n                      >\\n                        <Power className=\\\"w-7 h-7\\\" />\\n                        <span className=\\\"text-[11px] font-semibold tracking-tight\\\">\\n                          {vpnConnected ? \'\304\220ANG B\341\272\254T\' : \'\304\220\303\203 T\341\272\256T\'}\\n                        </span>\\n                      </button>\\n                    </div>\\n                  </div>\\n\\n                  {/* Quick Routing Architecture Strip */}\\n                  <div className=\\\"mt-6 pt-5 border-t border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800/80 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4 text-xs\\\">\\n                    <div>\\n                      <p className=\\\"text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400\\\">Chuy\341\273\203n h\306\260\341\273\233ng b\341\273\213 ch\341\272\267n</p>\\n                      <p className=\\\"mt-1 font-mono font-semibold text-rose-600 dark:text-rose-400 text-sm\\\">\\n                        0.0.0.0 (Local Sinkhole)\\n                      </p>\\n                    </div>\\n                    <div>\\n                      <p className=\\\"text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400\\\">DNS ph\303\242n gi\341\272\243i ngo\303\240i danh s\303\241ch</p>\\n                      <p className=\\\"mt-1 font-mono font-semibold text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 text-sm\\\">\\n                        {primaryDns} \302\267 {secondaryDns}\\n                      </p>\\n                    </div>\\n                    <div>\\n                      <p className=\\\"text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400\\\">Ch\341\272\277 \304\221\341\273\231 l\341\273\215c theo \341\273\251ng d\341\273\245ng</p>\\n                      <p className=\\\"mt-1 font-medium text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-200 text-sm\\\">\\n                        {filterMode === \'allowlist\'\\n                          ? `Ch\341\273\211 l\341\273\215c ${stats.selectedPackagesCount} g\303\263i \304\221\303\243 ch\341\273\215n`\\n                          : `To\303\240n m\303\241y (Lo\341\272\241i tr\341\273\253 ${stats.selectedPackagesCount} g\303\263i)`}\\n                      </p>\\n                    </div>\\n                  </div>\\n                </section>\\n\\n                {/* 4-Card KPI Telemetry Row */}\\n                <section className=\\\"grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-3.5\\\">\\n                  <div className=\\\"rounded-2xl bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 p-4\\\">\\n                    <p className=\\\"text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400\\\">\304\220\303\243 ch\341\272\267n (0.0.0.0)</p>\\n                    <p className=\\\"mt-1.5 text-2xl font-bold font-mono tabular-nums text-rose-600 dark:text-rose-400\\\">\\n                      {stats.totalBlockedHits.toLocaleString(\'vi-VN\')}\\n                    </p>\\n                    <p className=\\\"mt-1 text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 font-mono\\\">\\n                      {stats.blockRate}% t\341\273\225ng truy v\341\272\245n\\n                    </p>\\n                  </div>\\n\\n                  <div className=\\\"rounded-2xl bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 p-4\\\">\\n                    <p className=\\\"text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400\\\">T\341\273\225ng request DNS</p>\\n                    <p className=\\\"mt-1.5 text-2xl font-bold font-mono tabular-nums text-slate-900 dark:text-white\\\">\\n                      {stats.totalQueries.toLocaleString(\'vi-VN\')}\\n                    </p>\\n                    <p className=\\\"mt-1 text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 font-mono\\\">\\n                      Qua c\341\273\225ng UDP 53\\n                    </p>\\n                  </div>\\n\\n                  <div className=\\\"rounded-2xl bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 p-4\\\">\\n                    <p className=\\\"text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400\\\">T\303\252n mi\341\273\201n \304\221ang ch\341\272\267n</p>\\n                    <p className=\\\"mt-1.5 text-2xl font-bold font-mono tabular-nums text-slate-900 dark:text-white\\\">\\n                      {stats.enabledRulesCount}\\n                    </p>\\n                    <p className=\\\"mt-1 text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400\\\">\\n                      Tr\303\252n t\341\273\225ng {rules.length} quy t\341\272\257c\\n                    </p>\\n                  </div>\\n\\n                  <div className=\\\"rounded-2xl bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 p-4\\\">\\n                    <p className=\\\"text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400\\\">\304\220\341\273\231 tr\341\273\205 trung b\303\254nh</p>\\n                    <p className=\\\"mt-1.5 text-2xl font-bold font-mono tabular-nums text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400\\\">\\n                      {primaryDns === \'1.1.1.1\' ? \'14 ms\' : \'19 ms\'}\\n                    </p>\\n                    <p className=\\\"mt-1 text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 font-mono\\\">\\n                       Sinkhole: &lt;1 ms\\n                    </p>\\n                  </div>\\n                </section>\\n\\n                {/* Core 5 Xiaomi/MIUI Blocked Hosts Quick Control */}\\n                <section className=\\\"rounded-2xl bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 p-6\\\">\\n                  <div className=\\\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 pb-4 border-b border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800\\\">\\n                    <div>\\n                      <h2 className=\\\"text-base font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white font-display\\\">\\n                        Danh s\303\241ch t\303\252n mi\341\273\201n ch\341\272\267n m\341\273\245c ti\303\252u (0.0.0.0)\\n                      </h2>\\n                      <p className=\\\"text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 mt-0.5\\\">\\n                        B\341\272\255t ho\341\272\267c t\341\272\257t nhanh t\341\273\253ng m\303\241y ch\341\273\247 Xiaomi/MIUI. M\341\273\215i t\303\252n mi\341\273\201n kh\303\264ng thu\341\273\231c danh s\303\241ch n\303\240y s\341\272\275 \304\221i qua {primaryDns}.\\n                      </p>\\n                    </div>\\n                    <button\\n                      type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                      onClick={() => setActiveTab(\'blocklist\')}\\n                      className=\\\"min-h-[36px] px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 hover:underline whitespace-nowrap shrink-0 cursor-pointer\\\"\\n                    >\\n                      T\303\271y ch\341\273\211nh & Th\303\252m m\341\273\233i ({rules.length})\\n                    </button>\\n                  </div>\\n\\n                  <div className=\\\"divide-y divide-slate-100 dark:divide-slate-800/80\\\">\\n                    {rules.slice(0, 7).map((rule) => (\\n                      <div\\n                        key={rule.id}\\n                        className=\\\"py-3.5 flex items-center justify-between gap-4\\\"\\n                      >\\n                        <div className=\\\"min-w-0\\\">\\n                          <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2\\\">\\n                            <span\\n                              className={`font-mono text-sm font-medium truncate ${\\n                                rule.enabled\\n                                  ? \'text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100\'\\n                                  : \'text-slate-400 dark:text-slate-500 line-through\'\\n                              }`}\\n                            >\\n                              0.0.0.0 {rule.domain}\\n                            </span>\\n                          </div>\\n                          <div className=\\\"mt-0.5 flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400\\\">\\n                            <span className=\\\"truncate\\\">{rule.description}</span>\\n                            <span aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\302\267</span>\\n                            <span className=\\\"font-mono tabular-nums shrink-0\\\">\\n                              \304\220\303\243 ch\341\272\267n {rule.hitCount} l\341\272\247n\\n                            </span>\\n                          </div>\\n                        </div>\\n\\n                        <button\\n                          type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                          role=\\\"switch\\\"\\n                          aria-checked={rule.enabled}\\n                          onClick={() => handleToggleRule(rule.id)}\\n                          className={`min-h-[36px] min-w-[64px] px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-xs font-mono font-medium transition-colors shrink-0 cursor-pointer border ${\\n                            rule.enabled\\n                              ? \'bg-rose-500/10 text-rose-600 dark:text-rose-400 border-rose-500/30 hover:bg-rose-500/20\'\\n                              : \'bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800 text-slate-500 border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 hover:text-slate-800 dark:hover:text-slate-200\'\\n                          }`}\\n                        >\\n                          {rule.enabled ? \'CH\341\272\266N\' : \'T\341\272\256T\'}\\n                        </button>\\n                      </div>\\n                    ))}\\n                  </div>\\n                </section>\\n\\n                {/* Quick Per-App Summary Card */}\\n                <section className=\\\"rounded-2xl bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 p-6\\\">\\n                  <div className=\\\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3\\\">\\n                    <div>\\n                      <h2 className=\\\"text-base font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white font-display\\\">\\n                        Ph\341\272\241m vi \303\241p d\341\273\245ng tr\303\252n Package h\341\273\207 th\341\273\221ng\\n                      </h2>\\n                      <p className=\\\"text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 mt-0.5\\\">\\n                        {filterMode === \'allowlist\'\\n                          ? \'Ch\341\273\211 \304\221\341\273\213nh tuy\341\272\277n DNS cho c\303\241c package h\341\273\207 th\341\273\221ng \304\221\306\260\341\273\243c tick ch\341\273\215n (c\303\241c \341\273\251ng d\341\273\245ng c\303\241 nh\303\242n kh\303\241c \304\221i tr\341\273\261c ti\341\272\277p).\'\\n                          : \'\304\220\341\273\213nh tuy\341\272\277n DNS cho to\303\240n b\341\273\231 thi\341\272\277t b\341\273\213 v\303\240 b\341\273\217 qua c\303\241c package \304\221\306\260\341\273\243c tick ch\341\273\215n.\'}\\n                      </p>\\n                    </div>\\n                    <button\\n                      type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                      onClick={() => setActiveTab(\'packages\')}\\n                      className=\\\"min-h-[40px] px-3.5 py-2 rounded-lg text-xs font-medium bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800 text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200 hover:bg-slate-200 dark:hover:bg-slate-700 transition-colors whitespace-nowrap shrink-0 cursor-pointer\\\"\\n                    >\\n                      Ch\341\273\215n package h\341\273\207 th\341\273\221ng ({stats.selectedPackagesCount})\\n                    </button>\\n                  </div>\\n                </section>\\n              </>\\n            )}\\n\\n            {/* TAB 2: FULL REAL-TIME LOGS & DNS TESTER */}\\n            {activeTab === \'logs\' && (\\n              <section className=\\\"rounded-2xl bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 p-6 space-y-5\\\">\\n                <div className=\\\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 pb-4 border-b border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800\\\">\\n                  <div>\\n                    <h1 className=\\\"text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white font-display\\\">\\n                      Nh\341\272\255t k\303\275 k\341\272\277t n\341\273\221i DNS th\341\273\235i gian th\341\273\261c\\n                    </h1>\\n                    <p className=\\\"text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 mt-0.5\\\">\\n                      Theo d\303\265i tr\341\273\261c ti\341\272\277p m\341\273\215i g\303\263i tin DNS \304\221i qua giao di\341\273\207n TUN v\303\240 ki\341\273\203m th\341\273\255 quy t\341\272\257c ch\341\272\267n.\\n                    </p>\\n                  </div>\\n\\n                  <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2\\\">\\n                    <button\\n                      type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                      onClick={() => setStreamPaused((prev) => !prev)}\\n                      className=\\\"min-h-[40px] px-3 py-2 rounded-lg text-xs font-medium border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-800/70 hover:bg-slate-100 dark:hover:bg-slate-800 flex items-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap shrink-0 cursor-pointer\\\"\\n                    >\\n                      {streamPaused ? (\\n                        <>\\n                          <Play className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5 text-emerald-500\\\" />\\n                          <span>Ti\341\272\277p t\341\273\245c lu\341\273\223ng</span>\\n                        </>\\n                      ) : (\\n                        <>\\n                          <Pause className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5 text-amber-500\\\" />\\n                          <span>T\341\272\241m d\341\273\253ng</span>\\n                        </>\\n                      )}\\n                    </button>\\n                    <button\\n                      type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                      onClick={() => setLogs([])}\\n                      className=\\\"min-h-[40px] px-3 py-2 rounded-lg text-xs font-medium border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 hover:text-rose-500 flex items-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap shrink-0 cursor-pointer\\\"\\n                    >\\n                      <Trash2 className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5\\\" />\\n                      <span>X\303\263a log</span>\\n                    </button>\\n                  </div>\\n                </div>\\n\\n                {/* Interactive DNS Query Simulator Box */}\\n                <div className=\\\"p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-950 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 space-y-3\\\">\\n                  <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between\\\">\\n                    <span className=\\\"text-xs font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200\\\">\\n                      Ki\341\273\203m th\341\273\255 truy v\341\272\245n DNS (Gi\341\272\243 l\341\272\255p g\303\263i tin t\341\273\253 \341\273\251ng d\341\273\245ng)\\n                    </span>\\n                    <span className=\\\"text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 font-mono\\\">\\n                      DNS \304\221\303\255ch: {primaryDns}\\n                    </span>\\n                  </div>\\n\\n                  <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-12 gap-2.5\\\">\\n                    <div className=\\\"sm:col-span-5\\\">\\n                      <label className=\\\"sr-only\\\">Ch\341\273\215n Package</label>\\n                      <select\\n                        value={testPackage}\\n                        onChange={(e) => setTestPackage(e.target.value)}\\n                        className=\\\"w-full min-h-[42px] px-3 py-2 rounded-lg text-xs font-mono bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 focus:outline-none focus:border-emerald-500\\\"\\n                      >\\n                        {packages.map((p) => (\\n                          <option key={p.packageName} value={p.packageName}>\\n                            {p.packageName}\\n                          </option>\\n                        ))}\\n                      </select>\\n                    </div>\\n                    <div className=\\\"sm:col-span-5\\\">\\n                      <label className=\\\"sr-only\\\">T\303\252n mi\341\273\201n</label>\\n                      <input\\n                        type=\\\"text\\\"\\n                        value={testDomain}\\n                        onChange={(e) => setTestDomain(e.target.value)}\\n                        placeholder=\\\"Nh\341\272\255p domain c\341\272\247n ki\341\273\203m tra...\\\"\\n                        className=\\\"w-full min-h-[42px] px-3 py-2 rounded-lg text-xs font-mono bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 focus:outline-none focus:border-emerald-500\\\"\\n                      />\\n                    </div>\\n                    <div className=\\\"sm:col-span-2\\\">\\n                      <button\\n                        type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                        onClick={() => {\\n                          if (testDomain.trim()) {\\n                            evaluateDnsQuery(testDomain, testPackage);\\n                          }\\n                        }}\\n                        className=\\\"w-full min-h-[42px] px-3 py-2 rounded-lg text-xs font-medium bg-emerald-600 hover:bg-emerald-500 text-white transition-colors whitespace-nowrap shrink-0 cursor-pointer\\\"\\n                      >\\n                        G\341\273\255i th\341\273\255\\n                      </button>\\n                    </div>\\n                  </div>\\n\\n                  <div className=\\\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400\\\">\\n                    <span>Th\341\273\255 nhanh:</span>\\n                    {[\\n                      \'fraud-detection.engine.miui.com\',\\n                      \'flash.sec.miui.com\',\\n                      \'dm.wo.com.cn\',\\n                      \'play.googleapis.com\',\\n                    ].map((sampleDom) => (\\n                      <button\\n                        key={sampleDom}\\n                        type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                        onClick={() => {\\n                          setTestDomain(sampleDom);\\n                          evaluateDnsQuery(sampleDom, testPackage);\\n                        }}\\n                        className=\\\"font-mono text-xs text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 hover:text-emerald-500 dark:hover:text-emerald-400 underline underline-offset-2 cursor-pointer\\\"\\n                      >\\n                        {sampleDom}\\n                      </button>\\n                    ))}\\n                  </div>\\n                </div>\\n\\n                {/* Filter & Search Bar */}\\n                <div className=\\\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-stretch sm:items-center justify-between gap-3\\\">\\n                  <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-1 p-1 bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800 rounded-lg\\\">\\n                    <button\\n                      type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                      onClick={() => setLogFilter(\'ALL\')}\\n                      className={`px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium rounded-md transition-colors whitespace-nowrap shrink-0 cursor-pointer ${\\n                        logFilter === \'ALL\'\\n                          ? \'bg-white dark:bg-slate-950 text-slate-900 dark:text-white shadow-xs\'\\n                          : \'text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400\'\\n                      }`}\\n                    >\\n                      T\341\272\245t c\341\272\243 ({logs.length})\\n                    </button>\\n                    <button\\n                      type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                      onClick={() => setLogFilter(\'BLOCKED\')}\\n                      className={`px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium rounded-md transition-colors whitespace-nowrap shrink-0 cursor-pointer ${\\n                        logFilter === \'BLOCKED\'\\n                          ? \'bg-white dark:bg-slate-950 text-rose-600 dark:text-rose-400 shadow-xs\'\\n                          : \'text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400\'\\n                      }`}\\n                    >\\n                      \304\220\303\243 ch\341\272\267n 0.0.0.0\\n                    </button>\\n                    <button\\n                      type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                      onClick={() => setLogFilter(\'FORWARDED\')}\\n                      className={`px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium rounded-md transition-colors whitespace-nowrap shrink-0 cursor-pointer ${\\n                        logFilter === \'FORWARDED\'\\n                          ? \'bg-white dark:bg-slate-950 text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 shadow-xs\'\\n                          : \'text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400\'\\n                      }`}\\n                    >\\n                      Cho ph\303\251p ({primaryDns})\\n                    </button>\\n                  </div>\\n\\n                  <div className=\\\"relative flex-1 max-w-xs\\\">\\n                    <Search className=\\\"w-4 h-4 text-slate-400 absolute left-3 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2\\\" />\\n                    <input\\n                      type=\\\"text\\\"\\n                      value={logSearch}\\n                      onChange={(e) => setLogSearch(e.target.value)}\\n                      placeholder=\\\"T\303\254m domain ho\341\272\267c package...\\\"\\n                      className=\\\"w-full min-h-[38px] pl-9 pr-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-xs bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-950 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 focus:outline-none focus:border-emerald-500\\\"\\n                    />\\n                  </div>\\n                </div>\\n\\n                {/* Log Stream List */}\\n                <div className=\\\"divide-y divide-slate-100 dark:divide-slate-800/80 max-h-[540px] overflow-y-auto\\\">\\n                  {filteredLogs.length === 0 ? (\\n                    <div className=\\\"py-12 text-center text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400\\\">\\n                      Kh\303\264ng c\303\263 b\341\272\243n ghi k\341\272\277t n\341\273\221i n\303\240o kh\341\273\233p v\341\273\233i b\341\273\231 l\341\273\215c hi\341\273\207n t\341\272\241i.\\n                    </div>\\n                  ) : (\\n                    filteredLogs.map((item) => (\\n                      <div\\n                        key={item.id}\\n                        className=\\\"py-3 flex items-center justify-between gap-4 text-xs\\\"\\n                      >\\n                        <div className=\\\"min-w-0 space-y-1\\\">\\n                          <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2\\\">\\n                            <span\\n                              className={`font-mono font-semibold text-sm truncate ${\\n                                item.status === \'BLOCKED\'\\n                                  ? \'text-rose-600 dark:text-rose-400\'\\n                                  : \'text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100\'\\n                              }`}\\n                            >\\n                              {item.domain}\\n                            </span>\\n                          </div>\\n                          {/* Unboxed clean metadata with typographic separators */}\\n                          <div className=\\\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5 text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 font-mono\\\">\\n                            <span>{item.timestamp}</span>\\n                            <span aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\302\267</span>\\n                            <span>{item.packageName}</span>\\n                            <span aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\302\267</span>\\n                            <span>{item.appName}</span>\\n                          </div>\\n                        </div>\\n\\n                        <div className=\\\"text-right shrink-0 font-mono tabular-nums\\\">\\n                          <div\\n                            className={`font-semibold ${\\n                              item.status === \'BLOCKED\'\\n                                ? \'text-rose-600 dark:text-rose-400\'\\n                                : item.status === \'BYPASSED\'\\n                                ? \'text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400\'\\n                                : \'text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400\'\\n                            }`}\\n                          >\\n                            {item.status === \'BLOCKED\'\\n                              ? \'CH\341\272\266N \342\206\222 0.0.0.0\'\\n                              : item.status === \'BYPASSED\'\\n                              ? \'B\341\273\216 QUA VPN\'\\n                              : `CHO PH\303\211P \342\206\222 ${item.resolvedIp}`}\\n                          </div>\\n                          <div className=\\\"text-slate-400 dark:text-slate-500 mt-0.5\\\">\\n                            {item.queryType} \302\267 {item.latencyMs} ms\\n                          </div>\\n                        </div>\\n                      </div>\\n                    ))\\n                  )}\\n                </div>\\n              </section>\\n            )}\\n\\n            {/* TAB 3: BLOCKLIST MANAGER & XIAOMI/MIUI SUGGESTIONS */}\\n            {activeTab === \'blocklist\' && (\\n              <div className=\\\"space-y-6\\\">\\n                {/* Manual Domain Rule Entry Card */}\\n                <section className=\\\"rounded-2xl bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 p-6\\\">\\n                  <div className=\\\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 mb-4\\\">\\n                    <div>\\n                      <h1 className=\\\"text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white font-display\\\">\\n                        T\303\271y ch\341\273\211nh danh s\303\241ch ch\341\272\267n (0.0.0.0)\\n                      </h1>\\n                      <p className=\\\"text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 mt-0.5\\\">\\n                        Th\303\252m t\303\252n mi\341\273\201n th\341\273\247 c\303\264ng ho\341\272\267c d\303\241n tr\341\273\261c ti\341\272\277p \304\221\341\273\213nh d\341\272\241ng hosts (0.0.0.0 domain.com).\\n                      </p>\\n                    </div>\\n                    <button\\n                      type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                      onClick={handleResetDefaultRules}\\n                      className=\\\"min-h-[36px] px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-xs font-medium border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-900 dark:hover:text-white flex items-center gap-1.5 cursor-pointer\\\"\\n                    >\\n                      <RefreshCw className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5\\\" />\\n                      <span>Kh\303\264i ph\341\273\245c 5 domain g\341\273\221c</span>\\n                    </button>\\n                  </div>\\n\\n                  <form onSubmit={handleAddCustomDomain} className=\\\"space-y-3\\\">\\n                    <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-12 gap-3\\\">\\n                      <div className=\\\"sm:col-span-6\\\">\\n                        <label className=\\\"block text-xs font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 mb-1\\\">\\n                          T\303\252n mi\341\273\201n ho\341\272\267c d\303\262ng c\341\272\245u h\303\254nh hosts\\n                        </label>\\n                        <input\\n                          type=\\\"text\\\"\\n                          value={newDomainInput}\\n                          onChange={(e) => setNewDomainInput(e.target.value)}\\n                          placeholder=\\\"0.0.0.0 api.ad.xiaomi.com\\\"\\n                          className=\\\"w-full min-h-[42px] px-3.5 py-2 rounded-lg text-xs font-mono bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-950 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 focus:outline-none focus:border-emerald-500\\\"\\n                        />\\n                      </div>\\n                      <div className=\\\"sm:col-span-4\\\">\\n                        <label className=\\\"block text-xs font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 mb-1\\\">\\n                          Ghi ch\303\272 (T\303\271y ch\341\273\215n)\\n                        </label>\\n                        <input\\n                          type=\\\"text\\\"\\n                          value={newDomainDesc}\\n                          onChange={(e) => setNewDomainDesc(e.target.value)}\\n                          placeholder=\\\"V\303\255 d\341\273\245: Ch\341\272\267n qu\341\272\243ng c\303\241o MIUI\\\"\\n                          className=\\\"w-full min-h-[42px] px-3.5 py-2 rounded-lg text-xs bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-950 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 focus:outline-none focus:border-emerald-500\\\"\\n                        />\\n                      </div>\\n                      <div className=\\\"sm:col-span-2 flex items-end\\\">\\n                        <button\\n                          type=\\\"submit\\\"\\n                          className=\\\"w-full min-h-[42px] px-4 py-2 rounded-lg text-xs font-medium bg-emerald-600 hover:bg-emerald-500 text-white transition-colors flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap shrink-0 cursor-pointer\\\"\\n                        >\\n                          <Plus className=\\\"w-4 h-4\\\" />\\n                          <span>Th\303\252m</span>\\n                        </button>\\n                      </div>\\n                    </div>\\n\\n                    {domainInputError && (\\n                      <p className=\\\"text-xs text-rose-600 dark:text-rose-400\\\">\\n                        {domainInputError}\\n                      </p>\\n                    )}\\n                  </form>\\n                </section>\\n\\n                {/* Auto-Suggested Xiaomi / MIUI Telemetry Domains */}\\n                <section className=\\\"rounded-2xl bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 p-6\\\">\\n                  <div className=\\\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 pb-4 border-b border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800\\\">\\n                    <div>\\n                      <h2 className=\\\"text-base font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white font-display\\\">\\n                        G\341\273\243i \303\275 t\341\273\261 \304\221\341\273\231ng: T\303\252n mi\341\273\201n Telemetry & Qu\341\272\243ng c\303\241o Xiaomi/MIUI\\n                      </h2>\\n                      <p className=\\\"text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 mt-0.5\\\">\\n                        C\303\241c m\303\241y ch\341\273\247 thu th\341\272\255p d\341\273\257 li\341\273\207u ng\341\272\247m ph\341\273\225 bi\341\272\277n tr\303\252n ROM MIUI v\303\240 HyperOS. B\341\272\245m \304\221\341\273\203 th\303\252m v\303\240o danh s\303\241ch ch\341\272\267n.\\n                      </p>\\n                    </div>\\n                    {availableSuggestions.length > 0 && (\\n                      <button\\n                        type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                        onClick={handleAddAllSuggestions}\\n                        className=\\\"min-h-[38px] px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-xs font-medium bg-emerald-600/10 text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 border border-emerald-500/30 hover:bg-emerald-600/20 transition-colors whitespace-nowrap shrink-0 cursor-pointer\\\"\\n                      >\\n                        Th\303\252m t\341\272\245t c\341\272\243 ({availableSuggestions.length})\\n                      </button>\\n                    )}\\n                  </div>\\n\\n                  {availableSuggestions.length === 0 ? (\\n                    <p className=\\\"py-6 text-center text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400\\\">\\n                      To\303\240n b\341\273\231 t\303\252n mi\341\273\201n g\341\273\243i \303\275 c\341\273\247a Xiaomi/MIUI \304\221\303\243 \304\221\306\260\341\273\243c th\303\252m v\303\240o danh s\303\241ch ch\341\272\267n c\341\273\247a b\341\272\241n.\\n                    </p>\\n                  ) : (\\n                    <div className=\\\"divide-y divide-slate-100 dark:divide-slate-800/80\\\">\\n                      {availableSuggestions.map((sug) => (\\n                        <div\\n                          key={sug.domain}\\n                          className=\\\"py-3 flex items-center justify-between gap-4\\\"\\n                        >\\n                          <div className=\\\"min-w-0\\\">\\n                            <p className=\\\"font-mono text-sm font-medium text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 truncate\\\">\\n                              0.0.0.0 {sug.domain}\\n                            </p>\\n                            <div className=\\\"mt-0.5 flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400\\\">\\n                              <span>{sug.module}</span>\\n                              <span aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\302\267</span>\\n                              <span className=\\\"truncate\\\">{sug.description}</span>\\n                            </div>\\n                          </div>\\n                          <button\\n                            type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                            onClick={() =>\\n                              handleAddSuggestion(\\n                                sug.domain,\\n                                `${sug.module} \342\200\224 ${sug.description}`\\n                              )\\n                            }\\n                            className=\\\"min-h-[36px] px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-xs font-medium border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 hover:border-emerald-500 hover:text-emerald-500 transition-colors flex items-center gap-1 shrink-0 cursor-pointer\\\"\\n                          >\\n                            <Plus className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5\\\" />\\n                            <span>Ch\341\272\267n</span>\\n                          </button>\\n                        </div>\\n                      ))}\\n                    </div>\\n                  )}\\n                </section>\\n\\n                {/* Active Rules List */}\\n                <section className=\\\"rounded-2xl bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 p-6 space-y-4\\\">\\n                  <div className=\\\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-3\\\">\\n                    <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-1 p-1 bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800 rounded-lg\\\">\\n                      <button\\n                        type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                        onClick={() => setRuleFilter(\'all\')}\\n                        className={`px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium rounded-md transition-colors whitespace-nowrap shrink-0 cursor-pointer ${\\n                          ruleFilter === \'all\'\\n                            ? \'bg-white dark:bg-slate-950 text-slate-900 dark:text-white shadow-xs\'\\n                            : \'text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400\'\\n                        }`}\\n                      >\\n                        T\341\272\245t c\341\272\243 ({rules.length})\\n                      </button>\\n                      <button\\n                        type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                        onClick={() => setRuleFilter(\'default\')}\\n                        className={`px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium rounded-md transition-colors whitespace-nowrap shrink-0 cursor-pointer ${\\n                          ruleFilter === \'default\'\\n                            ? \'bg-white dark:bg-slate-950 text-slate-900 dark:text-white shadow-xs\'\\n                            : \'text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400\'\\n                        }`}\\n                      >\\n                        M\341\272\267c \304\221\341\273\213nh (5)\\n                      </button>\\n                      <button\\n                        type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                        onClick={() => setRuleFilter(\'enabled\')}\\n                        className={`px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium rounded-md transition-colors whitespace-nowrap shrink-0 cursor-pointer ${\\n                          ruleFilter === \'enabled\'\\n                            ? \'bg-white dark:bg-slate-950 text-slate-900 dark:text-white shadow-xs\'\\n                            : \'text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400\'\\n                        }`}\\n                      >\\n                        \304\220ang b\341\272\255t ({stats.enabledRulesCount})\\n                      </button>\\n                    </div>\\n\\n                    <div className=\\\"relative flex-1 max-w-xs\\\">\\n                      <Search className=\\\"w-4 h-4 text-slate-400 absolute left-3 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2\\\" />\\n                      <input\\n                        type=\\\"text\\\"\\n                        value={ruleSearch}\\n                        onChange={(e) => setRuleSearch(e.target.value)}\\n                        placeholder=\\\"L\341\273\215c t\303\252n mi\341\273\201n trong danh s\303\241ch...\\\"\\n                        className=\\\"w-full min-h-[38px] pl-9 pr-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-xs bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-950 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 focus:outline-none focus:border-emerald-500\\\"\\n                      />\\n                    </div>\\n                  </div>\\n\\n                  <div className=\\\"divide-y divide-slate-100 dark:divide-slate-800/80\\\">\\n                    {filteredRules.map((rule) => (\\n                      <div\\n                        key={rule.id}\\n                        className=\\\"py-3.5 flex items-center justify-between gap-4\\\"\\n                      >\\n                        <div className=\\\"min-w-0\\\">\\n                          <p\\n                            className={`font-mono text-sm font-medium truncate ${\\n                              rule.enabled\\n                                ? \'text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100\'\\n                                : \'text-slate-400 dark:text-slate-500 line-through\'\\n                            }`}\\n                          >\\n                            0.0.0.0 {rule.domain}\\n                          </p>\\n                          <div className=\\\"mt-0.5 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5 text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400\\\">\\n                            <span>\\n                              {rule.source === \'default\'\\n                                ? \'M\341\272\267c \304\221\341\273\213nh\'\\n                                : rule.source === \'suggested\'\\n                                ? \'G\341\273\243i \303\275 MIUI\'\\n                                : \'T\303\271y ch\341\273\211nh\'}\\n                            </span>\\n                            <span aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\302\267</span>\\n                            <span>{rule.description}</span>\\n                            <span aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\302\267</span>\\n                            <span className=\\\"font-mono tabular-nums\\\">\\n                              Ch\341\272\267n {rule.hitCount} l\341\272\247n\\n                            </span>\\n                          </div>\\n                        </div>\\n\\n                        <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2 shrink-0\\\">\\n                          <button\\n                            type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                            onClick={() => handleToggleRule(rule.id)}\\n                            className={`min-h-[36px] min-w-[64px] px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-xs font-mono font-medium transition-colors cursor-pointer border ${\\n                              rule.enabled\\n                                ? \'bg-rose-500/10 text-rose-600 dark:text-rose-400 border-rose-500/30\'\\n                                : \'bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800 text-slate-500 border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700\'\\n                            }`}\\n                          >\\n                            {rule.enabled ? \'\304\220ANG B\341\272\254T\' : \'\304\220\303\203 T\341\272\256T\'}\\n                          </button>\\n                          <button\\n                            type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                            onClick={() => handleDeleteRule(rule.id)}\\n                            aria-label={`X\303\263a ${rule.domain}`}\\n                            className=\\\"min-h-[36px] min-w-[36px] flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg text-slate-400 hover:text-rose-500 hover:bg-slate-100 dark:hover:bg-slate-800 transition-colors cursor-pointer\\\"\\n                          >\\n                            <Trash2 className=\\\"w-4 h-4\\\" />\\n                          </button>\\n                        </div>\\n                      </div>\\n                    ))}\\n                  </div>\\n                </section>\\n              </div>\\n            )}\\n\\n            {/* TAB 4: PER-APP SYSTEM PACKAGE SELECTOR */}\\n            {activeTab === \'packages\' && (\\n              <section className=\\\"rounded-2xl bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 p-6 space-y-5\\\">\\n                <div>\\n                  <h1 className=\\\"text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white font-display\\\">\\n                    L\341\273\215c theo Package h\341\273\207 th\341\273\221ng (Per-App VPN)\\n                  </h1>\\n                  <p className=\\\"text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 mt-0.5\\\">\\n                    S\341\273\255 d\341\273\245ng API VpnService.Builder c\341\273\247a Android \304\221\341\273\203 ch\341\273\211 \304\221\341\273\213nh ch\303\255nh x\303\241c nh\341\273\257ng package n\303\240o \304\221i qua b\341\273\231 l\341\273\215c DNS.\\n                  </p>\\n                </div>\\n\\n                {/* Flexible 2-Mode Switcher */}\\n                <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3\\\">\\n                  <button\\n                    type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                    onClick={() => setFilterMode(\'allowlist\')}\\n                    className={`p-4 rounded-xl border text-left transition-colors cursor-pointer ${\\n                      filterMode === \'allowlist\'\\n                        ? \'border-emerald-500 bg-emerald-500/5 dark:bg-emerald-500/10\'\\n                        : \'border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 hover:border-slate-300 dark:hover:border-slate-700\'\\n                    }`}\\n                  >\\n                    <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between\\\">\\n                      <span className=\\\"text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white\\\">\\n                        Ch\341\273\211 l\341\273\215c package \304\221\306\260\341\273\243c ch\341\273\215n\\n                      </span>\\n                      <span className=\\\"font-mono text-xs text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400\\\">\\n                        addAllowedApplication\\n                      </span>\\n                    </div>\\n                    <p className=\\\"mt-1 text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed\\\">\\n                      Khuy\303\252n d\303\271ng: Ch\341\273\211 \304\221\341\273\213nh tuy\341\272\277n c\303\241c g\303\263i h\341\273\207 th\341\273\221ng MIUI/Xiaomi \304\221\306\260\341\273\243c tick qua VPN. M\341\273\215i \341\273\251ng d\341\273\245ng kh\303\241c k\341\272\277t n\341\273\221i tr\341\273\261c ti\341\272\277p.\\n                    </p>\\n                  </button>\\n\\n                  <button\\n                    type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                    onClick={() => setFilterMode(\'blocklist\')}\\n                    className={`p-4 rounded-xl border text-left transition-colors cursor-pointer ${\\n                      filterMode === \'blocklist\'\\n                        ? \'border-emerald-500 bg-emerald-500/5 dark:bg-emerald-500/10\'\\n                        : \'border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 hover:border-slate-300 dark:hover:border-slate-700\'\\n                    }`}\\n                  >\\n                    <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between\\\">\\n                      <span className=\\\"text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white\\\">\\n                        L\341\273\215c to\303\240n m\303\241y & Lo\341\272\241i tr\341\273\253\\n                      </span>\\n                      <span className=\\\"font-mono text-xs text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400\\\">\\n                        addDisallowedApplication\\n                      </span>\\n                    </div>\\n                    <p className=\\\"mt-1 text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed\\\">\\n                      \303\201p d\341\273\245ng DNS VPN cho to\303\240n b\341\273\231 thi\341\272\277t b\341\273\213 Android, ngo\341\272\241i tr\341\273\253 c\303\241c package \304\221\306\260\341\273\243c tick trong danh s\303\241ch b\303\252n d\306\260\341\273\233i.\\n                    </p>\\n                  </button>\\n                </div>\\n\\n                {/* Package Search & Quick Actions */}\\n                <div className=\\\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-3 pt-2\\\">\\n                  <div className=\\\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5\\\">\\n                    <button\\n                      type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                      onClick={handleSelectAllMiuiPackages}\\n                      className=\\\"min-h-[36px] px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-xs font-medium bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-200 dark:hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200 transition-colors cursor-pointer\\\"\\n                    >\\n                      Ch\341\273\215n t\341\272\245t c\341\272\243 g\303\263i MIUI/Xiaomi\\n                    </button>\\n                    <button\\n                      type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                      onClick={() =>\\n                        setPackages((prev) =>\\n                          prev.map((p) => ({ ...p, selected: false }))\\n                        )\\n                      }\\n                      className=\\\"min-h-[36px] px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-xs font-medium border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-900 dark:hover:text-white transition-colors cursor-pointer\\\"\\n                    >\\n                      B\341\273\217 ch\341\273\215n t\341\272\245t c\341\272\243\\n                    </button>\\n                  </div>\\n\\n                  <div className=\\\"relative flex-1 max-w-xs\\\">\\n                    <Search className=\\\"w-4 h-4 text-slate-400 absolute left-3 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2\\\" />\\n                    <input\\n                      type=\\\"text\\\"\\n                      value={pkgSearch}\\n                      onChange={(e) => setPkgSearch(e.target.value)}\\n                      placeholder=\\\"T\303\254m com.miui.* ho\341\272\267c t\303\252n \341\273\251ng d\341\273\245ng...\\\"\\n                      className=\\\"w-full min-h-[38px] pl-9 pr-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-xs bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-950 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 focus:outline-none focus:border-emerald-500\\\"\\n                    />\\n                  </div>\\n                </div>\\n\\n                {/* Package Checkboxes List */}\\n                <div className=\\\"divide-y divide-slate-100 dark:divide-slate-800/80\\\">\\n                  {filteredPackages.map((pkg) => (\\n                    <label\\n                      key={pkg.packageName}\\n                      className=\\\"py-3.5 flex items-center justify-between gap-4 cursor-pointer select-none\\\"\\n                    >\\n                      <div className=\\\"min-w-0\\\">\\n                        <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2\\\">\\n                          <span className=\\\"text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100\\\">\\n                            {pkg.appName}\\n                          </span>\\n                        </div>\\n                        <div className=\\\"mt-0.5 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5 text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 font-mono\\\">\\n                          <span className=\\\"text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400\\\">\\n                            {pkg.packageName}\\n                          </span>\\n                          <span aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\302\267</span>\\n                          <span>UID {pkg.uid}</span>\\n                          <span aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\302\267</span>\\n                          <span className=\\\"font-sans\\\">{pkg.category}</span>\\n                        </div>\\n                        <p className=\\\"mt-1 text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400\\\">\\n                          {pkg.description}\\n                        </p>\\n                      </div>\\n\\n                      <input\\n                        type=\\\"checkbox\\\"\\n                        checked={pkg.selected}\\n                        onChange={() => handleTogglePackage(pkg.packageName)}\\n                        className=\\\"w-5 h-5 rounded accent-emerald-600 cursor-pointer shrink-0\\\"\\n                      />\\n                    </label>\\n                  ))}\\n                </div>\\n              </section>\\n            )}\\n          </div>\\n\\n          {/* RIGHT SIDEBAR: LIVE REAL-TIME DNS STREAM & QUICK TESTER (5 columns on desktop) */}\\n          <aside className=\\\"lg:col-span-5 space-y-6\\\">\\n            <div className=\\\"rounded-2xl bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 p-5 space-y-4\\\">\\n              <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between gap-2 pb-3 border-b border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800\\\">\\n                <div>\\n                  <h2 className=\\\"text-base font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white font-display\\\">\\n                    Gi\303\241m s\303\241t g\303\263i tin tr\341\273\261c ti\341\272\277p\\n                  </h2>\\n                  <p className=\\\"text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400\\\">\\n                    {vpnConnected\\n                      ? streamPaused\\n                        ? \'Lu\341\273\223ng gi\303\241m s\303\241t \304\221ang t\341\272\241m d\341\273\253ng\'\\n                        : \'\304\220ang b\341\272\257t g\303\263i tin UDP 53 theo th\341\273\235i gian th\341\273\261c\'\\n                      : \'VPN \304\221ang t\341\272\257t\'}\\n                  </p>\\n                </div>\\n\\n                <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-1.5\\\">\\n                  <button\\n                    type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                    onClick={() => setStreamPaused((prev) => !prev)}\\n                    className=\\\"min-h-[36px] px-2.5 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-xs font-medium border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 hover:bg-slate-100 dark:hover:bg-slate-800 transition-colors cursor-pointer\\\"\\n                  >\\n                    {streamPaused ? \'Ti\341\272\277p t\341\273\245c\' : \'T\341\272\241m d\341\273\253ng\'}\\n                  </button>\\n                  {activeTab !== \'logs\' && (\\n                    <button\\n                      type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                      onClick={() => setActiveTab(\'logs\')}\\n                      className=\\\"min-h-[36px] px-2.5 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-xs font-medium text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 hover:underline cursor-pointer\\\"\\n                    >\\n                      M\341\273\237 r\341\273\231ng\\n                    </button>\\n                  )}\\n                </div>\\n              </div>\\n\\n              {/* Compact Quick Test Trigger */}\\n              <div className=\\\"p-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-950 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 space-y-2\\\">\\n                <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between text-xs\\\">\\n                  <span className=\\\"font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300\\\">\\n                    B\341\272\257n g\303\263i tin DNS ki\341\273\203m th\341\273\255 nhanh:\\n                  </span>\\n                  <span className=\\\"font-mono text-slate-500\\\">\\n                    {testPackage.replace(\'com.\', \'\')}\\n                  </span>\\n                </div>\\n                <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2\\\">\\n                  <input\\n                    type=\\\"text\\\"\\n                    value={testDomain}\\n                    onChange={(e) => setTestDomain(e.target.value)}\\n                    placeholder=\\\"Nh\341\272\255p domain...\\\"\\n                    className=\\\"flex-1 min-h-[38px] px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-xs font-mono bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 focus:outline-none focus:border-emerald-500\\\"\\n                  />\\n                  <button\\n                    type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                    onClick={() => {\\n                      if (testDomain.trim()) {\\n                        evaluateDnsQuery(testDomain, testPackage);\\n                      }\\n                    }}\\n                    className=\\\"min-h-[38px] px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-xs font-medium bg-emerald-600 hover:bg-emerald-500 text-white transition-colors whitespace-nowrap shrink-0 cursor-pointer\\\"\\n                  >\\n                    Ki\341\273\203m tra\\n                  </button>\\n                </div>\\n              </div>\\n\\n              {/* Live Feed Rows */}\\n              <div className=\\\"divide-y divide-slate-100 dark:divide-slate-800/80 max-h-[390px] overflow-y-auto pr-1\\\">\\n                {logs.slice(0, 12).map((entry) => (\\n                  <div\\n                    key={entry.id}\\n                    className=\\\"py-2.5 flex items-center justify-between gap-3 text-xs\\\"\\n                  >\\n                    <div className=\\\"min-w-0\\\">\\n                      <p\\n                        className={`font-mono font-medium truncate ${\\n                          entry.status === \'BLOCKED\'\\n                            ? \'text-rose-600 dark:text-rose-400\'\\n                            : \'text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100\'\\n                        }`}\\n                      >\\n                        {entry.domain}\\n                      </p>\\n                      <div className=\\\"mt-0.5 flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[11px] text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 font-mono\\\">\\n                        <span>{entry.timestamp}</span>\\n                        <span aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\302\267</span>\\n                        <span className=\\\"truncate\\\">{entry.packageName}</span>\\n                      </div>\\n                    </div>\\n\\n                    <div className=\\\"text-right font-mono tabular-nums shrink-0\\\">\\n                      <span\\n                        className={`font-semibold ${\\n                          entry.status === \'BLOCKED\'\\n                            ? \'text-rose-600 dark:text-rose-400\'\\n                            : entry.status === \'BYPASSED\'\\n                            ? \'text-amber-500\'\\n                            : \'text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400\'\\n                        }`}\\n                      >\\n                        {entry.resolvedIp}\\n                      </span>\\n                      <p className=\\\"text-[11px] text-slate-400\\\">\\n                        {entry.latencyMs} ms\\n                      </p>\\n                    </div>\\n                  </div>\\n                ))}\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            {/* Export Hosts & Native Kotlin Code Card */}\\n            <div className=\\\"rounded-2xl bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 p-5 space-y-3\\\">\\n              <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between\\\">\\n                <h3 className=\\\"text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white font-display\\\">\\n                  C\341\272\245u h\303\254nh Hosts & Kotlin VpnService\\n                </h3>\\n                <span className=\\\"text-xs font-mono text-slate-500\\\">\\n                  \304\220\341\273\223ng b\341\273\231 t\341\273\261 \304\221\341\273\231ng\\n                </span>\\n              </div>\\n              <p className=\\\"text-xs text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed\\\">\\n                Xu\341\272\245t danh s\303\241ch ch\341\272\267n \304\221\341\273\213nh d\341\272\241ng <code className=\\\"font-mono\\\">0.0.0.0</code> ho\341\272\267c l\341\272\245y tr\341\273\215n b\341\273\231 m\303\243 ngu\341\273\223n Kotlin <code className=\\\"font-mono\\\">MiGuardVpnService.kt</code> \304\221\303\243 nh\303\272ng s\341\272\265n c\341\272\245u h\303\254nh hi\341\273\207n t\341\272\241i c\341\273\247a b\341\272\241n.\\n              </p>\\n              <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-2.5 pt-1\\\">\\n                <button\\n                  type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                  onClick={() =>\\n                    handleDownloadFile(\'miguard-hosts.txt\', generatedHostsContent)\\n                  }\\n                  className=\\\"min-h-[40px] px-3 py-2 rounded-lg text-xs font-medium border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-100 dark:hover:bg-slate-800 flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap cursor-pointer\\\"\\n                >\\n                  <Download className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5\\\" />\\n                  <span>T\341\272\243i file hosts</span>\\n                </button>\\n                <button\\n                  type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                  onClick={() => setShowCodeModal(true)}\\n                  className=\\\"min-h-[40px] px-3 py-2 rounded-lg text-xs font-medium bg-slate-900 dark:bg-white text-white dark:text-slate-950 hover:opacity-90 flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap cursor-pointer\\\"\\n                >\\n                  <Code2 className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5\\\" />\\n                  <span>Xem code Kotlin</span>\\n                </button>\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n          </aside>\\n        </div>\\n      </main>\\n\\n      {/* MOBILE BOTTOM NAVIGATION BAR (Ergonomic Thumb Zone, <15% viewport height) */}\\n      <nav\\n        aria-label=\\\"\304\220i\341\273\201u h\306\260\341\273\233ng di \304\221\341\273\231ng\\\"\\n        className=\\\"md:hidden fixed bottom-0 left-0 right-0 z-40 h-16 bg-white/95 dark:bg-slate-950/95 backdrop-blur-md border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 grid grid-cols-4 items-center px-2\\\"\\n      >\\n        <button\\n          type=\\\"button\\\"\\n          onClick={() => setActiveTab(\'dashboard\')}\\n          className={`min-h-[48px] flex flex-col items-center justify-center rounded-xl transition-colors cursor-pointer ${\\n            activeTab === \'dashboard\'\\n              ? \'text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400\'\\n              : \'text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400\'\\n          }`}\\n        >\\n          <Shield className=\\\"w-5 h-5\\\" />\\n          <span className=\\\"text-[11px] font-medium mt-1 whitespace-nowrap\\\">\\n            \304\220i\341\273\201u khi\341\273\203n\\n          </span>\\n        </button>\\n\\n        <button\\n          type=\\\"button\\\"\\n          onClick={() => setActiveTab(\'logs\')}\\n          className={`min-h-[48px] flex flex-col items-center justify-center rounded-xl transition-colors cursor-pointer ${\\n            activeTab === \'logs\'\\n              ? \'text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400\'\\n              : \'text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400\'\\n          }`}\\n        >\\n          <Activity className=\\\"w-5 h-5\\\" />\\n          <span className=\\\"text-[11px] font-medium mt-1 whitespace-nowrap\\\">\\n            Nh\341\272\255t k\303\275\\n          </span>\\n        </button>\\n\\n        <button\\n          type=\\\"button\\\"\\n          onClick={() => setActiveTab(\'blocklist\')}\\n          className={`min-h-[48px] flex flex-col items-center justify-center rounded-xl transition-colors cursor-pointer ${\\n            activeTab === \'blocklist\'\\n              ? \'text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400\'\\n              : \'text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400\'\\n          }`}\\n        >\\n          <Filter className=\\\"w-5 h-5\\\" />\\n          <span className=\\\"text-[11px] font-medium mt-1 whitespace-nowrap\\\">\\n            Danh s\303\241ch ch\341\272\267n\\n          </span>\\n        </button>\\n\\n        <button\\n          type=\\\"button\\\"\\n          onClick={() => setActiveTab(\'packages\')}\\n          className={`min-h-[48px] flex flex-col items-center justify-center rounded-xl transition-colors cursor-pointer ${\\n            activeTab === \'packages\'\\n              ? \'text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400\'\\n              : \'text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400\'\\n          }`}\\n        >\\n          <Layers className=\\\"w-5 h-5\\\" />\\n          <span className=\\\"text-[11px] font-medium mt-1 whitespace-nowrap\\\">\\n            G\303\263i h\341\273\207 th\341\273\221ng\\n          </span>\\n        </button>\\n      </nav>\\n\\n      {/* MODAL: DYNAMIC ANDROID KOTLIN VPNSERVICE SOURCE CODE & HOSTS EXPORT */}\\n      {showCodeModal && (\\n        <div className=\\\"fixed inset-0 z-50 bg-black/60 backdrop-blur-xs flex items-center justify-center p-4\\\">\\n          <div className=\\\"bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 rounded-2xl max-w-4xl w-full max-h-[88vh] flex flex-col overflow-hidden shadow-2xl\\\">\\n            <div className=\\\"px-6 py-4 border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 flex items-center justify-between gap-4\\\">\\n              <div>\\n                <h2 className=\\\"text-base font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white font-display\\\">\\n                  M\303\243 ngu\341\273\223n Android VPN & C\341\272\245u h\303\254nh Hosts (T\341\273\261 \304\221\341\273\231ng \304\221\341\273\223ng b\341\273\231)\\n                </h2>\\n                <p className=\\\"text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400\\\">\\n                  \304\220\303\243 nh\303\272ng {stats.enabledRulesCount} domain ch\341\272\267n (0.0.0.0), DNS {primaryDns} v\303\240 {stats.selectedPackagesCount} package h\341\273\207 th\341\273\221ng.\\n                </p>\\n              </div>\\n              <button\\n                type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                onClick={() => setShowCodeModal(false)}\\n                aria-label=\\\"\304\220\303\263ng c\341\273\255a s\341\273\225 m\303\243 ngu\341\273\223n\\\"\\n                className=\\\"min-h-[40px] min-w-[40px] rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center text-slate-500 hover:text-slate-900 dark:hover:text-white hover:bg-slate-100 dark:hover:bg-slate-800 cursor-pointer\\\"\\n              >\\n                <X className=\\\"w-5 h-5\\\" />\\n              </button>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            <div className=\\\"px-6 py-3 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-950 border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3\\\">\\n              <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-1 p-1 bg-slate-200/70 dark:bg-slate-900 rounded-lg\\\">\\n                <button\\n                  type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                  onClick={() => setActiveCodeTab(\'kotlin\')}\\n                  className={`px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-mono font-medium rounded-md transition-colors cursor-pointer ${\\n                    activeCodeTab === \'kotlin\'\\n                      ? \'bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 text-slate-900 dark:text-emerald-400 shadow-xs\'\\n                      : \'text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400\'\\n                  }`}\\n                >\\n                  MiGuardVpnService.kt\\n                </button>\\n                <button\\n                  type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                  onClick={() => setActiveCodeTab(\'hosts\')}\\n                  className={`px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-mono font-medium rounded-md transition-colors cursor-pointer ${\\n                    activeCodeTab === \'hosts\'\\n                      ? \'bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 text-slate-900 dark:text-emerald-400 shadow-xs\'\\n                      : \'text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400\'\\n                  }`}\\n                >\\n                  hosts.txt (0.0.0.0)\\n                </button>\\n                <butto