  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining Kotlin Files**\n\nI\'m currently focused on defining the core Kotlin source files for the Android application. I\'m starting with `VpnRepository.kt`, which will use `StateFlow`, `SharedPreferences` to manage shared state between the `MainActivity` and the `MiGuardVpnService`, and also implement a rudimentary state machine. I\'ll need to define the data structures for the VPN state.\n\n\n**Implementing DNS Packet Handling**\n\nI\'m now diving into the implementation of `DnsPacketHelper.kt`. I\'m focusing on parsing and building raw DNS packets, specifically handling IPv4, UDP, and DNS components. I\'m building a system to block specific domains by constructing valid DNS responses with `0.0.0.0`, while properly calculating checksums. I\'m also preparing to wrap upstream UDP responses back into IPv4 packets.\n\n\n**Constructing VPN Components**\n\nI\'m now deep in the core `VpnService` implementation. This involves reading rules and DNS configurations from the `VpnRepository` and configuring the VPN builder accordingly. I\'m also working on intercepting packets, logging real-time data, and ensuring log purging occurs based on the specified retention window. I\'m now developing the UI components of the `MainActivity.kt` file, specifically the four bottom navigation tabs. I\'ll get to implementing the functionality now that the skeleton is created.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_463993"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"package com.miguard.dns.data\\n\\nimport kotlinx.coroutines.flow.MutableStateFlow\\nimport kotlinx.coroutines.flow.StateFlow\\nimport kotlinx.coroutines.flow.asStateFlow\\n\\nenum class PerAppMode {\\n    ALLOWLIST, // Ch\341\273\211 l\341\273\215c DNS cho c\303\241c package \304\221\306\260\341\273\243c ch\341\273\215n (addAllowedApplication)\\n    BLOCKLIST  // L\341\273\215c to\303\240n m\303\241y v\303\240 lo\341\272\241i tr\341\273\253 c\303\241c package \304\221\306\260\341\273\243c ch\341\273\215n (addDisallowedApplication)\\n}\\n\\ndata class BlockRule(\\n    val domain: String,\\n    val enabled: Boolean = true,\\n    val isDefault: Boolean = false,\\n    val hitCount: Long = 0\\n)\\n\\ndata class DnsLogRecord(\\n    val id: Long,\\n    val timestampMs: Long,\\n    val domain: String,\\n    val blocked: Boolean,\\n    val resolvedTarget: String,\\n    val latencyMs: Long\\n)\\n\\nobject VpnRepository {\\n    const val DEFAULT_RETENTION_DAYS = 7L\\n    private const val DAY_MS = 24 * 60 * 60 * 1000L\\n\\n    private val _vpnRunning = MutableStateFlow(false)\\n    val vpnRunning: StateFlow<Boolean> = _vpnRunning.asStateFlow()\\n\\n    private val _primaryDns = MutableStateFlow(\\\"1.1.1.1\\\")\\n    val primaryDns: StateFlow<String> = _primaryDns.asStateFlow()\\n\\n    private val _retentionDays = MutableStateFlow(DEFAULT_RETENTION_DAYS)\\n    val retentionDays: StateFlow<Long> = _retentionDays.asStateFlow()\\n\\n    private val _perAppMode = MutableStateFlow(PerAppMode.ALLOWLIST)\\n    val perAppMode: StateFlow<PerAppMode> = _perAppMode.asStateFlow()\\n\\n    // 5 t\303\252n mi\341\273\201n Xiaomi/MIUI ch\341\272\267n m\341\272\267c \304\221\341\273\213nh v\341\273\201 0.0.0.0\\n    private val _rules = MutableStateFlow(\\n        listOf(\\n            BlockRule(\\\"fraud-detection.engine.miui.com\\\", enabled = true, isDefault = true),\\n            BlockRule(\\\"flash.sec.miui.com\\\", enabled = true, isDefault = true),\\n            BlockRule(\\\"dm.wo.com.cn\\\", enabled = true, isDefault = true),\\n            BlockRule(\\\"data.mistat.xiaomi.com\\\", enabled = true, isDefault = true),\\n            BlockRule(\\\"tracking.miui.com\\\", enabled = true, isDefault = true)\\n        )\\n    )\\n    val rules: StateFlow<List<BlockRule>> = _rules.asStateFlow()\\n\\n    // Danh s\303\241ch g\341\273\243i \303\275 t\341\273\261 \304\221\341\273\231ng c\303\241c domain telemetry Xiaomi/MIUI\\n    val miuiSuggestions = listOf(\\n        \\\"data.mistat.intl.xiaomi.com\\\",\\n        \\\"tracking.intl.miui.com\\\",\\n        \\\"api.ad.xiaomi.com\\\",\\n        \\\"sdkconfig.ad.xiaomi.com\\\",\\n        \\\"ccc.sys.miui.com\\\",\\n        \\\"abtest.mistat.xiaomi.com\\\",\\n        \\\"metok.sys.miui.com\\\",\\n        \\\"sec-cdn.static.xiaomi.net\\\"\\n    )\\n\\n    private val _selectedPackages = MutableStateFlow(\\n        setOf(\\n            \\\"com.miui.securitycenter\\\",\\n            \\\"com.miui.analytics\\\",\\n            \\\"com.miui.daemon\\\",\\n            \\\"com.miui.msa.global\\\",\\n            \\\"com.xiaomi.joyose\\\",\\n            \\\"com.xiaomi.finddevice\\\",\\n            \\\"com.miui.guardprovider\\\"\\n        )\\n    )\\n    val selectedPackages: StateFlow<Set<String>> = _selectedPackages.asStateFlow()\\n\\n    private val _logs = MutableStateFlow<List<DnsLogRecord>>(emptyList())\\n    val logs: StateFlow<List<DnsLogRecord>> = _logs.asStateFlow()\\n\\n    fun setVpnRunning(running: Boolean) {\\n        _vpnRunning.value = running\\n    }\\n\\n    fun setPrimaryDns(dns: String) {\\n        if (dns == \\\"1.1.1.1\\\" || dns == \\\"8.8.8.8\\\") {\\n            _primaryDns.value = dns\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fun setRetentionDays(days: Long) {\\n        _retentionDays.value = days\\n        purgeExpiredLogs()\\n    }\\n\\n    fun setPerAppMode(mode: PerAppMode) {\\n        _perAppMode.value = mode\\n    }\\n\\n    fun togglePackage(packageName: String) {\\n        val current = _selectedPackages.value.toMutableSet()\\n        if (current.contains(packageName)) {\\n            current.remove(packageName)\\n        } else {\\n            current.add(packageName)\\n        }\\n        _selectedPackages.value = current\\n    }\\n\\n    fun addOrEnableRule(rawInput: String) {\\n        val clean = rawInput.trim().lowercase()\\n            .removePrefix(\\\"0.0.0.0\\\")\\n            .removePrefix(\\\"127.0.0.1\\\")\\n            .trim()\\n        if (clean.isEmpty()) return\\n        val current = _rules.value.toMutableList()\\n        val existingIdx = current.indexOfFirst { it.domain == clean }\\n        if (existingIdx >= 0) {\\n            current[existingIdx] = current[existingIdx].copy(enabled = true)\\n        } else {\\n            current.add(0, BlockRule(domain = clean, enabled = true, isDefault = false))\\n        }\\n        _rules.value = current\\n    }\\n\\n    fun toggleRule(domain: String) {\\n        _rules.value = _rules.value.map {\\n            if (it.domain == domain) it.copy(enabled = !it.enabled) else it\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fun removeRule(domain: String) {\\n        _rules.value = _rules.value.filterNot { it.domain == domain }\\n    }\\n\\n    fun shouldBlockDomain(domain: String): Boolean {\\n        val q = domain.lowercase()\\n        val matched = _rules.value.firstOrNull { rule ->\\n            rule.enabled && (q == rule.domain || q.endsWith(\\\".${rule.domain}\\\"))\\n        }\\n        if (matched != null) {\\n            _rules.value = _rules.value.map {\\n                if (it.domain == matched.domain) it.copy(hitCount = it.hitCount + 1) else it\\n            }\\n            return true\\n        }\\n        return false\\n    }\\n\\n    fun recordDnsLog(domain: String, blocked: Boolean, resolvedTarget: String, latencyMs: Long) {\\n        val now = System.currentTimeMillis()\\n        val cutoff = now - (_retentionDays.value * DAY_MS)\\n        val entry = DnsLogRecord(\\n            id = now xor domain.hashCode().toLong(),\\n            timestampMs = now,\\n            domain = domain,\\n            blocked = blocked,\\n            resolvedTarget = resolvedTarget,\\n            latencyMs = latencyMs\\n        )\\n        _logs.value = (listOf(entry) + _logs.value.filter { it.timestampMs >= cutoff }).take(300)\\n    }\\n\\n    /**\\n     * X\303\263a c\303\241c b\341\272\243n ghi log k\341\272\277t n\341\273\221i c\305\251 h\306\241n th\341\273\235i gian c\341\272\245u h\303\254nh (M\341\272\267c \304\221\341\273\213nh 7 ng\303\240y)\\n     */\\n    fun purgeExpiredLogs(customDays: Long = _retentionDays.value): Int {\\n        val cutoff = System.currentTimeMillis() - (customDays * DAY_MS)\\n        val before = _logs.value.size\\n        _logs.value = _logs.value.filter { it.timestampMs >= cutoff }\\n        return before - _logs.value.size\\n    }\\n\\n    fun clearAllLogs() {\\n        _logs.value = emptyList()\\n    }\\n}\\n\",\"Description\":\"Create VpnRepository.kt for managing rules, per-app packages, and 7-day log retention\",\"Overwrite\":true,\"TargetFile\":\"/android/app/src/main/java/com/miguard/dns/data/VpnRepository.kt\",\"toolAction\":\"Creating VpnRepository.kt\",\"toolSummary\":\"Create VpnRepository.kt for state and 7-day log retention\"}"
