  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Discovering Key Constraints**\n\nI\'ve just realized a critical constraint: the AI Studio preview sandbox appears to be a Node.js web container, lacking the standard Android development tools. This means the typical Android SDK and JDK components are absent. I\'m now wrestling with a major puzzle: how can the user achieve effortless `.apk` file compilation without needing to install Android Studio?\n\n\n**Formulating the Solution**\n\nI\'ve been working on a user-friendly solution for `.apk` file compilation. My current plan is to offer a downloadable, pre-configured Android project bundle. This bundle will include Kotlin source files, dynamically updated with the user\'s settings, and a ready-to-use GitHub Actions workflow. Users can either upload the project to GitHub for automated building or open it in Android Studio for local compilation.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_412865"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"name: Build MiGuard DNS Android APK\\n\\non:\\n  push:\\n    branches: [ \\\"main\\\", \\\"master\\\" ]\\n  workflow_dispatch:\\n\\njobs:\\n  build-apk:\\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\\n\\n    steps:\\n      - name: Checkout repository\\n        uses: actions/checkout@v4\\n\\n      - name: Set up JDK 17\\n        uses: actions/setup-java@v4\\n        with:\\n          java-version: \'17\'\\n          distribution: \'temurin\'\\n\\n      - name: Setup Gradle\\n        uses: gradle/actions/setup-gradle@v3\\n        with:\\n          gradle-version: \'8.7\'\\n\\n      - name: Build Debug APK\\n        working-directory: ./android\\n        run: gradle assembleDebug --no-daemon\\n\\n      - name: Upload Compiled APK Artifact\\n        uses: actions/upload-artifact@v4\\n        with:\\n          name: MiGuard-DNS-APK\\n          path: android/app/build/outputs/apk/debug/app-debug.apk\\n\",\"Description\":\"Create GitHub Actions workflow to automatically compile and upload the Android APK\",\"Overwrite\":true,\"TargetFile\":\"/.github/workflows/build-apk.yml\",\"toolAction\":\"Creating GitHub Actions APK builder workflow\",\"toolSummary\":\"Create .github/workflows/build-apk.yml for cloud APK compilation\"}"
      thinking_signature: "\022\275\021\n\272\021\001i\024}\023\347<\035d,\365\233\371m\224\035\227\244i\026^\230\230\257\206\376\006~\311\336\362\211a\277\314UmG\247\224e\315\232\346\225\366\037l\310\360\205h\020\270\240\254\300\234\261\351\201\374\033Qx\237\247\236\342f\310a0\322gB\036p\357T\244\264\211J\247\232\230\t#\375\023\bgVw>/\230\2243{4\360\200\022Tx+\377onl\021\037\251$\243\315Q\3007\216\202\035yql\362\242|\036\203\370\240)e\274\rK\262G\236Z\v\0261\320\241\n\354\344.\226\206\303\004\aS+\r~\332k\225\262\322\244\237\0351_$\351X \313cn!\244\265\371\'z\311\356\271\024\033u\321,\317\323\3738\267\323<\247\316\n\202\360u^{\340Q}\254_m\005\210\vl\203\217\223a\331\016\rH\001\"\355\321\271/mq\031\205K\204M\0300\177\372I,\261v2\336\b\026$\vl\334\3671\300t4G\336\253\260\302\364x\235\272m\024\211\344B\333\"~U\267%\f*\237%S\241A<\353\317NO\034\313\357\377+\234m\021\245\374\341\340Ez\272~\004\337\332\330\346v\364\213Q]\314\266\251\300\3069\3502\335Q\245#uO1\342\234\211\025\315V\356=0\336\aF8t\3600&\031\355+?<b7\210\006\242w@v\301\331\336\nJ1\236,\244\027\035\301o\356\232N\364\303\212\331\231\300e\213\330\207,\231j\321\276\023:\304<\022\203\374\344\000J\241.=\276\3262\fU\001\256\210u6\345\330i\236e\310\274\333lD\334\365\314(\277\222\032T\343|,\214\362\270\302\024-\311\344\r\232\245*t\255y\265\367Q4\324\361\242\212\035b\264\345Vw\250\245A!V0\224k&\a$\244\240\"m-\334\034\345\r\301\223\023] \326\243yMH\266b\222\275\252\005\030\313\337z\v\263\201|\267\317\023^\270\202\002\225\206) y\333\306\316Er\302\261\250z\300>\210\262\304\250\230\303\344\230-i\332#|\330\347\250\360m\224r\317\341E0\336d\324\017\246f\203\200\346\304\3343\177\371\212\232\275\025\021\236\3362\216\343\326\326\n\215`c\237\311\267\017\304i\034\235\203\036\360\277.a\220\256d\177\376\232\234\372F\246\377\352\177\365\357\275\373\260\263%\331G}\303[cv\252\377\352Cs[\221\332\3334\203\340\364\277\273a\352\226\252\356&\365\275\030E\210X\321\343\300^\320\230\341\231\305\022\342\024\026\261\036k\f\240(v:<\371\377l%\243\